<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwena Maber ma Luka Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwena Maber ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Kwena Maber ma Luka</char> ocoyo nyutu Yecu macalo Lalar mayam con kiciko pire bot jo Icrael dok bene en aceli aye Lalar pa jo ducu ma iwi lobo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka oryeyo kore kikore ni Cwiny Maleng pa Rwot aye olwongo Yecu me “kelo Kwena Maber bot lucan” 4:18, dok Kwena Maber man bene opong ki lok ma mako dano ki peko mapatpat magitye kwede. Lok ma mako yomcwiny bene pire tye matek mada i buk pa Luka, tutwale i cura mukwongo makelo lok me kwena ma mako kit ma Yecu obino kwede, ka dok i ladole nyutu kit ma Yecu odok kwede malo i polo. Lacoc man bene tito lok ma nyutu kit ma niye pa Lukricitayo onya odoko pol kwede ikin piny kit ma en otito i buk me Tic Pa Lukwena.</para>
  <para style="ip">Coc ma kipoko i dul aryo madito (me acele mako lok matye i cura 1—2 ki me aryone kwako lok matye i buk man cake i cura 9—19) ma opong ki coc manonge i buk me Kwena Maber man keken, calo lok ma tito pi wer pa lumalaika ki kit ma lukwat guringo me cito ka limo kwede latin Yecu ma kinywalo i akul dyang, kit ma ginongo ki Yecu i Ot pa Lubanga, carolok ikom lacamariya maber ki carolok pa latin awobi ma orwenyo. Lok ma pire tek ma bene kinwoyo pire mada en aye lok me lega, Cwiny maleng, tic ma mon gutiyo i dog tic pa Yecu, ki kit ma Lubanga weko nyo rucu ki bal.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nywal ki kare me tino pa Jon Labatija ki pa Yecu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Jon Labatija <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Batija pa Yecu ki atematema ma en owok iye <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Yecu ikin lwak ma i Galilaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Aa pa Yecu ki i Galilaya me oo i Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cabit me agiki pa Yecu i Jerucalem ki ikin gangi ma cokcok ki kunu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28—23:56</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cer ki i lyel, nyute, ki dok pa Rwot Yecu i polo <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="is">Luka</para>
  <para style="ip">Jami aryo ma nen kamaleng i Kwena Maber ma Luka ocoyo gin aye: Lubanga tamo matek pi lucan ki pi jo ma piny oloyo, ki bene Cwiny maleng en aye tye mic pa Lubanga madit maloyo ducu bot jo ducu ma kwaye. Coc pa Luka orwate mapol ki coc pa Marako ki pa Matayo, ento en bene tye ki carolok ma pe nonge i buk me Kwena Maber mukene, macalo carolok ikom Lacamariya maber 10:25-37. Ki Awobi ma orwenyo 15:11-32. Lacoc me buk pa Luka en aye bene obedo lacoc me buk me Tic Pa Lukwena.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bot Teopilo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Jo mapol dong gutiyo matek me coyo lok ikom gin ma otime ikinwa, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />macalo jo ma guneno ki wanggi nia i acaki, dok ma gudoko lutic me lok meno, ci gukwango botwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Pimeno, Ladit Teopilo, ka dong angiyo gin ducu nia i acaki, an bene atamo ni bedo ber ka ce acoyo piri, kun aryeyo gin lok meno kore ki kore, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />wek iniang ada me lok meno mayam kipwonyi kwedeni.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 2:4-10">1 Tec 2:4-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ikare pa Kerode, rwot me Judaya, onongo tye ajwaka pa Lubanga mo ma nyinge Jakaria, me wang tic pa Abiya. En yam tye ki dakone ma ikin anyira pa Aron, nyinge Elicabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Gin aryo ducu yam kitgi atir inyim Lubanga, kun gilubu cik pa Rwot ducu labongo bal. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ento onongo gipeke ki lutino, pien Elicabet yam lalur, dok gin aryo ducu onongo dong guti woko.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ikare ma Jakaria tye katiyo tic me ajwaka inyim Lubanga, ikare me dog tice, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />macalo kit pa ajwaki tye, kwir opoto ikome me donyo i Ot pa Rwot ka wango odok ma ngwece kur icawa me lega. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ka lwak dano ducu onongo pud gitye woko kalega icawa me wango odok ma ngwece kur. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Lamalaika pa Rwot onen bote kun ocung tung lacuc inget keno tyer me wango odok ma ngwece kur. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ka Jakaria onene, ci cwinye opoto, lworo omake. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ento lamalaika owace ni, “Pe ibed ki lworo, Jekariya, pien Lubanga dong owinyo legani. Dakoni Elicabet binywali latin laco, ci ibicako nyinge Jon. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ibibedo ki yomcwiny, cwinyi bikwee, jo mapol cwinygi bibedo yom pi nywale; <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Wel 6:3</ref></char></note> pien en bibedo madit inyim Rwot. En pe bimato kongo bwino kadi gin mamero dano; en bipong ki Cwiny Maleng, nia ki i mine. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />En bidwoko jo Icrael mapol bot Rwot Lubangagi. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref></char></note> En bitelo nyim Rwot i cwiny ki tek pa Eliya, pi loko cwiny wegi lutino me dwoko ikom lutinogi; pi dwoko dano ma lujemo cen i yo me ryeko pa jo ma kitgi atir, dok me yubu pi Rwot jo madong gutere pire.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Ci Jakaria openyo lamalaika ni, “Abingeyo man ningning? Pien an dong atii woko, dakona bene dong otii.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char></note> Lamalaika ogamo doge ni, “An Gabriel, acung inyim Lubanga; kiora kalok kwedi, akeli kwena man maber. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Winy ba, ibiling ma pe itwero loko lok mo, nio inino meno ma lok man bitime iye, pien in pe iye loka, ma bicobbe ka kare ne oromo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Lwak onongo gubedo kakuru Jakaria, guuru pi riine tutwal i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ka Jakaria okati woko, onongo pe twero lok kwedgi, omiyo guniang ni oneno ginanyuta i Ot pa Lubanga. En obedo ka gwelogi kun pe twero lok. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ka kare me tice otum, ci odok i pacone.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ka kare okato manok, dakone Elicabet ogamo ic. Okane kwede pi dwe abic, kun waco ni, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Rwot otimo kitmeno ikoma, ikare ma onena ki kica, me kwanyo lewic woko ki ikoma ikin dano.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitito pi nywalo Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ka Elicabet dong iye oromo dwe abicel, Lubanga ooro lamalaika Gabriel i taun madit mo i Galilaya, ma nyinge Najaret, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat 1:18</ref></char></note> bot nyako ma peya ongeyo laco, ma laco ma nyinge Yucepu otongo keny ikome. <figure style="fig" alt="The Angel came to Mary" file="CN01606b.tif" size="col" loc="Luke 1:27" copy="David Cook" ref="1:27">Lamalaika obino bot Maliam.</figure> nyinge Maliam. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Lamalaika obino bote, ci omote ni, “Itye ba, in ma kimiyi gum! Rwot tye kwedi!” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ento cwiny Maliam opoto pi lok man, obedo ka tamo telok me mot man. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Lamalaika owace ni, “Pe ibed ki lworo, Maliam; pien ilimo cwak ki bot Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat 1:21</ref></char></note> Nen, ibiyac, ibinywalo latin laco, ibicako nyinge Yecu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Cam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Ica 9:7</ref></char></note> En bibedo dit, kibilwonge ni, Wod pa En Mamalo Twal; Rwot Lubanga bimiye komker pa kwarone Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />En biloyo jo me ot pa Yakobo matwal; kere pe bigik.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliam openyo lamalaika ni, “Lok man bibedo ningning, ma kun an pe ya angene ki laco?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Lamalaika odoke iye ni, “Cwiny Maleng bibino ikomi, ci tek pa En Mamalo Twal biumi macalo tipu; pimeno latin ma ibinywaloni kibilwonge Maleng, Wod pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nen, watti Elicabet dong oyac iwi tiyone, binywalo latin laco; en mayam kilwongo ni lalur kombedi dong tye ki ic me dwe abicel. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Aca 18:14</ref> </char></note> Pien pe tye gin mo maloyo Lubanga <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maliam owaco ni, “Nen, an angeca pa Rwot; wek obed bota kit macalo iwaco.” Lacen lamalaika oa woko ki bote.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliam olimo Elicabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ikare meno Maliam oa, ocito oyotoyot i lobo ma obedo godigodi i taun madit mo me Juda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ci odonyo i ot pa Jakaria, omoto Elicabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ka Elicabet owinyo mot pa Maliam, ci latin otinge ki i iye. Elicabet opong ki Cwiny Maleng, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />ka odange ki dwon malongo ni, “Itye ki gum ikin mon, latin ma i ii bene tye ki gum! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Lok man kono oa ki kwene, lutuwa, min Rwoda me bino bota! <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Pien nen, ma awinyo dwon me moti, latin ma i iya otinge ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Itye ki gum, in ma iye, ni lok ma Rwot otito boti bicobbe kakare.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer me pak pa Maliam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Cam 2:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Maliam owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Kwona pako Rwot,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />cwinya yom ikom Lubanga ma Lalara,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />pien oneno an angecane ki cwak, an ma latice ma mwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Nen, nia tin yalwak me kare ducu gibilwonga ni lagumkom;<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />pien Won Twer Ducu otima gin madit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">nyinge bene leng.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />En tye ki kica ikom yalwak me kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">ki ikom jo ducu ma gilwore.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Otiyo tic matek ki bade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">olalo luwake i yub me cwinygi.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Oreto luker ki iwi komkergi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">omiyo dito bot jo ma rwomgi piny;<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />jo ma kec nekogi omiyo guyeng ki gin maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">oryemo lulonyo gudok cen ki cinggi nono.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Okonyo latice Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">opo pi timo kicane,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17">Aca 17</ref> </char>
    </note> kit macalo oloko bot kwariwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">bot Abraim ki bot likwaye matwal.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliam orii bot Elicabet dwe adek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:56">ka lacen odok i pacone.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma kinywalo kwede Jon Labatija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ka kare me nywal pa Elicabet dong oromo, ci onywalo latin laco. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Ka dano ducu ma bedo cok ingetgi ki wadine guwinyo ni Rwot onyutu kicane madwong ikome kuman, cwinygi obedo yom kacel kwede. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref></char></note> Inino me aborone gubino ka liro latin. Gumito cako nyinge ki nying wone Jakaria, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />ento mine ogamo ni, “Pe kitmeno, kibilwonge ni Jon.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Gudoke iye ni, “Pe tye ngat mo ma nyinge calo meno ikin wadiwu ducu do.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Gugwelo wone me penye ni en mito cako nyinge anga? <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />En openyo pi got coc, ci ocoyo ni, “Nyinge Jon.” Gin ducu guuru. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Cutcut dog Jakaria oyabe, telebe ogonye, ci oloko kun pako Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Lworo omako dano ducu ma bedo cok ingetgi; lok meno ducu oywek i lobo Judaya ducu ma obedo gotgot. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Dano ducu ma guwinyo gumako i cwinygi, kun giwaco ni, “Latin man kite bibedo ningning?” Pien cing Rwot tye kwede.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Jakaria otito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Wone Jakaria opong ki Cwiny Maleng, ci oloko lok me nebi ni,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Kipak Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">pien dong olimo jone, ci okokogi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Omiyo botwa Lalar matek i ot pa latice Daudi,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />macalo yam oloko ki i dog lunebine maleng ma gubedo nia con ki con,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />me larowa ki bot lukworwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">ki i cing jo ducu ma kwerowa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Otimo kica bot kwariwa ka dok opo ikom gicikene maleng<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />ma en aye kwong ma okwongo bot kwarowa Abraim,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ni ebilarowa ki i cing lukworwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">wek dong watii bote labongo lworo,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kun wabedo leng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">dok kitwa atir inyime pi nino me kwowa ducu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> In bene latin, kibilwongi ni lanebi pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">pien ibitelo nyim Rwot pi yubu yone,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />kun imiyo ngec me lar bot roke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">lar mabino pi weko bal.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Pi kica madwong pa Lubangawa, dero me rupiny bimenyowa kun a ki malo,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Ica 9:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> me menyo jo ma bedo i piny macol ki i tipu me to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ki me tiro tyenwa i yo me kuc.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Latin odongo, kun otegi matek ikom ki cwiny, obedo i tim nio inino ma kinyute iye bot jo Icrael.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kit ma kinywalo kwede Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ikare meno cik oa ki bot Cecar Augucito ni kicoo nying dano ducu ma gitye i teloc pa jo Roma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Man obedo coc mukwongo ma kicoyo, ikare ma Kurenio loyo lobo Ciria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Dano ducu gucito ka cone, ngat acel acel i taun madit gi. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yucepu bene oa ki i Galilaya, ki i taun madit me Najaret, ocito i Judaya, i taun madit kal pa Daudi ma kilwongo Beterekem, pien en yam ngat acel ikin likwayo pa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />En ocito ka cone ki dakone Maliam ma onongo otongo keny ikome, ma onongo oyac. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ikare ma gitye kunu, kare me nywale oromo. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Onywalo latin kayone ma laco, oumu kome ki bongo, opyele kwede i wee me pito dyangi, pien onongo ot welo opong woko.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwat ki lumalaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />I lobo kunu onongo tye iye lukwat ma gibedo i olet, kun gigwoko romigi dyewor. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Cutcut lamalaika pa Rwot oturu ki bino, onen botgi, deyo pa Rwot oryeny orumugi, ci lworo omakogi matek. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Lamalaika owaco botgi ni, “Pe wulwor, pien nen, akeliwu lok maber me yomcwiny ma bibedo bot dano ducu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Tin i taun madit kal pa Daudi kinywalo pirwu Lalar, en Kricito Rwot. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Man bibedo gin ma nyutu: wubinongo latin ma kiumu ki bongo, ma kipyele, obutu i wee me pito dyangi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Oyotoyot lwak mony me polo onongo tye kacel ki lamalaika meno; ci gupako Lubanga kun giwaco ni,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Deyo obed bot Lubanga malo i lalenge lenge polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">kuc obed i lobo ikin jo ma en pwoyo!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ka dong lamalaika oa woko ki botgi, odok i polo, ci lukwat guloko keken gi ni, “Kong wacitu mono wa i Beterekem, wek wacinenu gin man ma otime, ma Rwot otitiwa pireni.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Gucito oyotoyot, ci gunongo Maliam ki Yucepu, ki latin lakere ma kipyelo i wee me pito dyangi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ka guneno, gutito bot dano lok mayam kitito botgi ikom latin meno; <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />dano ducu ma guwinyo guuru lok ma lukwat gutito botgi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ento Maliam okano lok magi ducu, kun tamo pire ki i cwinye. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Lukwat gudok kun kimiyo deyo bot Lubanga, gupake pi gin ducu ma guwinyo, dok guneno, kit mayam kitito botgi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cako nying Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka nino aboro dong oromo me liro latin, kicako nyinge Yecu, nying ma lamalaika yam ocako ma en pud peya tye i ic.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kidyero latin Yecu i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lev 12:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka kare dong oromo me lonyegi kit macalo tye i Cik pa Moses, ci gutero latin Yecu i Jerucalem wek kidyere bot Rwot, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Nia 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note> kit macalo kicoyo i Cik pa Rwot ni “Lutino kayo ducu ma co kibidyerogi bot Rwot”, <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />dok wek kityer gitum, kit ma kicoyo i cik pa Rwot ni: Amam aryo, nyo lutino akuri aryo.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ikare meno onongo tye laco mo i Jerucalem ma nyinge Cimeon. En yam dano ma kite atir ma lworo Lubanga, kun kuru kare ma kibikweyo iye cwiny jo Icrael; Cwiny Maleng onongo tye kwede. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Cwiny Maleng onongo otyeko nyutu bote ni, en pe bito ma peya oneno Kricito pa Rwot. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />En obino i Ot pa Lubanga kun Cwiny Maleng aye tele. Ka lunyodo gukelo latin Yecu wek kitime kit macalo tye i Cik, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Cimeon otinge ikore ci opwoyo Lubanga kun waco ni,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Koni dong icik latici, Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">ocit ki kuc kit macalo yam iciko;<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />pien wanga dong oneno lari,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ma iyubu inyim rok ducu,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Ica 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char>
    </note> me bedo dero ma yabo mungi bot Lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">ki deyo bot joni Icrael.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Wone ki mine guuru lok ma kiwaco ikome. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Cimeon olego gum ikomgi, kun waco bot mine Maliam ni, “Nen, latin man kiketo me reto ki me ilo jo Icrael mapol, ki me bedo lanyut ma kibilok marac ikome, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />dok pala lucwane bicobo cwinyi pil, wek tam ma i cwiny dano mapol oyabe kamaleng.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Yam tye lanebi mo ma dako, nyinge Ana, nya pa Panuel, pa jo Acer. Onongo dong otii tutwal. En yam obedo otyeko mwaka abiro keken bot cware cake ikare ma ki nyome. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Inge to pa cware, en orii nio mwaka pyere aboro wiye angwen me dite kun en dato. En yam pe a ki i Ot pa Lubanga, obedo ka woro Lubanga kun rii kec dok lego dyewor ki dyeceng. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />En obino icawanu, ci opwoyo Lubanga, ka otito pi latinu bot dano ducu mayam kuru kare me koko jo Jerucalem.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gudok cen i Najaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat 2:23</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka Yocepu gin ki Maliam dong gutyeko cobo lok ducu matye i cik pa Rwot, ci gudok i Galilaya, i taun madit gi i Najaret. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Latin odongo odoko matek, kun opong ki ryeko; ci cwiny Lubanga obedo yom ikome.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latin Yecu i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Nia 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Nwo 16:1-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Lunyodo pa Yecu yam gicito i Jerucalem mwaka ki mwaka pi nino madit me Karama me Kato. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ka mwaka me dite oromo apar wiye aryo, ci gucito kunu kit macalo tye i cik me nino madito. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ka nino me karama dong otum, magidok paco, latin Yecu odong woko i Jerucalem. Lunyodone onongo pe gingeyo, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />ento gutamo ni en tye ikin lwak. Guwoto wot me nino acel, guyenye ikin lutugi ki ikin luwotgi; <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />ka pe gunonge, ci gudok cen i Jerucalem ka yenye. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ka nino adek okato, ci gunonge i ot pa Lubanga; obedo ikin lupwonye, kun winyo pwonygi, dok penyogi. <figure style="fig" alt="They found Jesus in the Temple among the teachers" file="CN01648B.tif" size="col" loc="Luke 2:46" copy="David cook" ref="2:46">Kinongo Yecu i Ot pa Lubanga ikin lupwonye</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Dano ducu mayam guwinye guuru niange, ki kit ma en dok kwede i peny. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ka lunyodone gunene, guuru; mine openye ni, “Latina, pingo itimowa kit man? Nen woru ki an wabedo ka yenyi kun wakumu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />En ogamo dogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuyenya pingo? Pe wungeyo ni myerona me bedo i Ot pa Abana?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ento pe guniang lok ma en oloko botgi. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ci en owoto kacel kwedgi, obino i Najaret, obedo kun winyogi; mine okano lok meno ducu i cwinye.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Cam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Car 3:4</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu odongo kun mede i ryeko, dok bene mede ki nongo cwak, pwoc ki bot Lubanga wa ki bot dano bene.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Jon Labatija otito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19">Jon 1:19</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:20">20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye abic me loc pa Tiberio Cecar, ikare ma Pilato onongo loyo Judaya, Kerode onongo loyo lobo Galilaya. Omine Pilipo kono onongo loyo lobo Ituria ki Trakoniti, Lucania onongo loyo Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anac ki Kayapa gin aye onongo ajwaki madito pa Lubanga, ikare meno lok pa Lubanga obino bot Jon wod pa Jakaria i tim. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />En owoto i lobo ducu ma cokcok ki Judaya kun tito lok me kwenane ni, “Wungut, wek kibatijawu, ci Lubanga biweko balwu,” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Ica 40:3-5</ref></char></note> kit macalo kicoyo i buk pa lanebi Icaya ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Dwon dano mo ma dange i tim ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">wuger yo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">wutir yone ocung atir.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Lung ducu kibitoro woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">godi ki cere ducu kibidwokogi woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">kama ogone kibitiro cung atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">dok yo ma obedo burbur kibipiro woko.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Dano ducu gibineno lar pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref> </char>
    </note> Jon owaco bot lwak ma gubino bote pi batija ni, “Wun lutino ororo, anga ma otito botwu ni wuring woko ki i akemo pa Lubanga matye ka binoni? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jon 8:33</ref> </char></note> Dong wutii gin ma nyutu ni wungut ikom balwu, pe dok wucak tamo ni, ‘Watye ki kwarowa Abraim.’ Kong wunen, awaco botwu ni, Lubanga tye ki twero me miyo gweng magi loke doko likwayo Abraim. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref></char></note> Kombedi dong kiketo latong woko ilwit yadi; yat acel acel ma pe nyako nyige mabeco, kitongo kireto woko piny, ci kibolo woko i mac.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Lwak gupenye ni, “Watim ango dong?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />En odok iye botgi ni, “Ngat matye ki kanyi aryo opok bot ngat ma pe kwede; ngat matye ki cam otim kitmeno bene.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk 7:29</ref> </char></note> Lujog mucoro bene gubino wek kibatijagi, ci gupenye ni, “Lapwony, wan kono watim ango?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Owaco botgi ni, “Pe wujog makato wel ma kicikowu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Acikari bene gupenye ni, “Wan kono watim ango?” En owaco botgi ni, “Pe wuyak ngat mo, pe wudot dano mo ki lok goba, wek mucarawu oromwu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ka lwak gitye kakuru, kun gipenye ki i cwinygi pi Jon, ka kono en Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Jon odok iye botgi ni, “An abatijawu ki pii, ento ngat ma kata ki tek tye kabino, ma an pe amyero me gonyo ware. En bibatijawu ki Cwiny Maleng, dok ki mac. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Oderone tye i cinge me pyeto ngano ducu ma i larone, en bidilo nganone idero, ento cunge en biwango woko ki mac ma pe to.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ki lwak lok meno ducu Jon obedo katito lok me Kwena Maber bot lwak kun cuko ki cwinygi me dwogo bot Lubanga kun giloke gibwoto timgi maracu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref> </char></note> Ento Jon yam bene ojuku Kerode rwot madit pi bedo ki Kerodia ma ciomine, ki pi time maracu ducu, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ci Kerode dok omede i yone me timo bal, en opongo wiye ki tweyo Jon woko i buc.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jon obatija Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ka dong Jon obatija dano ducu, ma Yecu bene dong kibatija, kun en onongo tye kalega, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aca 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Jab 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ica 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char></note> ci polo oyabe, Cwiny Maleng olyane piny i cal pa akuri, ci opye ikome. Ci dwon owinye ma a ki i polo kun waco ni, “In aye i Woda ma amaro, ma cwinya yom ikomi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwari pa Yecu Kricito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Ikare ma Yecu ocako tice onongo dong tye ki mwaka mamito romo pyere adek me dite. Yam onongo kitamo ni, en wod pa Yucepu, ma en wod pa Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />wod pa Matat, wod pa Levi, wod pa Melki, wod pa Janai, wod pa Yucepu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />wod pa Matatia, wod pa Amoc, wod pa Nakum, wod pa Eceli, wod pa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />wod pa Maat, wod pa Mattatia, wod pa Cemein, wod pa Yocek, wod pa Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />wod pa Yoanan, wod pa Reca, wod pa Jerubabel, wod pa Cealtiel, wod pa Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />wod pa Melki, wod pa Adi, wod pa Kocam, wod pa Elmadam, wod pa Er, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />wod pa Yocwa, wod pa Eliejer, wod pa Yorim, wod pa Matat, wod pa Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />wod pa Cimeon, wod pa Juda, wod pa Yucepu, wod pa Yonam, wod pa Eliakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />wod pa Melea, wod pa Mena, wod pa Matata, wod pa Natan, wod pa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />wod pa Yece, wod pa Obed, wod pa Boaj, wod pa Cala, wod pa Nakucon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />wod pa Aminadab, wod pa Admin, wod pa Arni, wod pa Kejeron, wod pa Perej, wod pa Juda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />wod pa Yakobo, wod pa Icaka, wod pa Abraim, wod pa Tera, wod pa Nakor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />wod pa Cerug, wod pa Reu, wod pa Peleg, wod pa Eber, wod pa Cela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />wod pa Kainan, wod pa Arpakcad, wod pa Cem, wod pa Nua, wod pa Lamek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />wod pa Metucela, wod pa Enoka, wod pa Jared, wod pa Maalalel, wod pa Kainan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />wod pa Enoci, wod pa Ceji, wod pa Adam, wod pa Lubanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Catan obito Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yecu odwogo ki i Jordan kun opong ki Cwiny Maleng, cutcut Cwiny Maleng otere wa i tim. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ci orii i tim pi nino pyere angwen, kun Catan obedo ka bite. En pe ocamo gin mo ikare meno ducu; ka otyeko rii kec, ci kec oneke. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Catan owace ni, “Ka in i Wod pa Lubanga, wac ki gweng man wek oloke odok kwon.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Nwo 8:3</ref> </char></note> Ento Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kicoyo ni, ‘Dano pe bibedo kwo ki kwon keken.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Catan dok otere malo, onyute ker ducu ma iwi lobo ikine me kare manok mo, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />ci owace ni, “Abimiyi twer man ducu ki deyo man ducu, pien kityeko miyo bota, atwero miyo bot ngat ma an amito. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Pimeno, ka iwora, ci jami magi ducu bibedo meri.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nwo 6:13</ref> </char></note> Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kicoyo ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="wj">‘Wor Rwot Lubangani,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="wj">dok bene itii pire keken.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Dok otere i Jerucalem, ci ocibe ocung iwi labila Ot pa Lubanga, ci owace ni, “Ka in i wod pa Lubanga, a ki malo kany ipot piny, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Jab 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref> </char></note> pien yam bene kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘En biciko lumalaikane piri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">wek gugwoki,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />dok bene ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">‘Gin bijoli ki cinggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">wek pe iyok tyeni ikom got.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Nwo 6:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Yecu dok ogamo doge owace ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kiwaco ni, ‘Pe item i Rwot Lubangani.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ka Catan dong otyeko bite, ci oweke kun kuru kare maber.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocako tice i Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yecu odwogo i Galilaya ma opong ki tek pa Cwiny Maleng; pire oywek i lobo ducu ma orumu kunu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />En opwonyo ikacokegi, ci dano ducu guketo deyo ikome.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwero Yecu i Najaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yecu obino i Najaret kama yam en odongo iye, ci odonyo i kacoke i ceng Cabit, kit macalo kite onongo tye. En oa malo ka kwan; <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />ci kimiye buk pa lanebi Icaya. En oyabo buk, ci oyenyo kama kicoyo ni,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Ica 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Cwiny pa Rwot tye ikoma,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">pien Rwot dong oyera woko</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">wek atit lok me Kwena Maber bot lucan.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Oora me tito bot jo matye i opii ni kibigonyogi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">ki bot jo ma wanggi oto ni kibiyabo wanggi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">ki me gonyo jo ma kidiyogi wek gucit ki kuc,</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <char style="wj">dok pi tito pi mwaka ma Rwot binyutu iye kica mere bot dano.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ci Yecu odolo buk, odwoko bot latic me kacoke, ci obedo piny katito lok; dano ducu ma ikacoke guciko wanggi ikome. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ocako tito botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Tin ginacoya man ocobo kakare kun wuwinyo ki itwu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Dano ducu guloko lok maber ikome, kun giuru lok me kica ma oa ki idoge. Gupenyo ni, “Man pe wod pa Yucepu?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />En ogamo dog gi ni, <char style="wj">“Angeyo atir ni wubibolo carolok man ikoma, ni, ‘Daktar, cangge keni, tic mayam wawinyo itiyo i Kapernaum, tii kany bene i pacowa kikome.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jon 4:44</ref> </char></note> Dok omede ki lok kwedgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco ki wun ni, pe tye lanebi mo ma kijolo i lobo tuggi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Luk 17:1</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento atito botwu atir ni, i lobo Icrael ikare pa Eliya yam tye iye mon mapol ma coggi oto, ma kot okwero cwer pi mwaka adek ki dwe abicel, ci kec laparanat opoto i lobo meno ducu;</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Luk 17:8-16</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">ento Lubanga pe ocwalo Eliya bot ngat mo ikin gi, kono bot dato mo ma i Carepat i lobo Cidon.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Luk 5:1-14</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Dok i lobo Icrael ikare pa lanebi Elica onongo yam tye iye ludobo mapol; ento pe kicango mo ikin gi, kono Naaman Laciria keken.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ka dano ducu ma ikacoke guwinyo lok man, kiniga omakogi matek. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Gutware malo, gutere woko ki i taun madit, gukele iwi got ma gugero gangi iwiye wek gicore piny. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ento Yecu opuce woko ki idyergi, ci ocito gire.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano matye ki cen marac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yecu ocito i Kapernaum ma en aye taun madit ma i Galilaya. Obedo ka pwonyogi kunu iceng Cabit; <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref> </char></note> ci guuru pwonye, pien en nongo loko ki twero. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />I kacoke meno onongo tye iye dano matye ki cen marac ci en odange ki dwon malongo ni, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ilaro gin ango kwedwa ka, in Yecu Lanajaret? Dong ibino ka tyekowa bo? An angeyi, in i Ngat Maleng pa Lubanga” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Ento Yecu ojuke kun wace ni, <char style="wj">“Ling mot, a woko ki ikome!”</char> Cen orete piny inyimgi, ci oa woko ki ikome kun pe otime marac. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Dano ducu guuru, kun gipenye keken gi ni, “Man lok ango? Pien en ciko cen marac ki twero dok ki tek, ci gia woko.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Pire oywek ikabedo ducu ma orumu kunu.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango maro Cimon Petero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Mat 8:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Mar 1:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yecu oa okato woko ki i kacoke, odonyo i ot pa Cimon. Maro pa Cimon onongo tye ki two lyeto ma obwoye matek; gubako dogi bote pire. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yecu ocung ka ngete, ocoko lyeto, ci two ocang woko ki ikome; cutcut oa malo, ocako gwokogi.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango jo mapol otyeno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">Mat 8:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Mar 1:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ka ceng dong mito poto, dano ducu matye ki lutwo, ma twogi patpat, gukelogi bote. En oketo cinge ikomgi ki acel acel ci ocangogi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Cen maracu bene oa ki ikom jo mapol, kun gidange ni, “In i Wod pa Lubanga!” Ento Yecu ojukugi, kun pe oye cen mo oloko, pien onongo gingeye, ni en Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ka piny oru, Yecu ocito ikabedo mo ma dano peke iye. Ento lwak gubedo ka yenye, ci gubino bote, gutemo juke wek en pe oa ki botgi. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ento en owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Myero atit lok me Kwena Maber me ker pa Lubanga i taun madito mukene bene, pien pi lok man Lubanga ceng iora ni atii.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ci en obedo katito lok i kacoke ma i Judaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo lucik rec</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mat 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mar 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>
    </note> Inino mo acel ma Yecu ocung i dog nam Genecaret lwak dano gudine cok bote pi winyo lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ci en oneno yeya aryo i dog nam; lumak rec onongo gua woko ki i igi, gitye ka lwoko obwogi. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yecu oito i yeya acel ma onongo pa Cimon, olege ni kong okwang manok i nam. En obedo piny, opwony lwak kun tye ki i yeya. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ka en dong otyeko lok, ci owaco bot Cimon ni, <char style="wj">“Kwang icit i kut, ci wubol obwowu wumak rec.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jon 21:3</ref> </char></note> Cimon odoke iye ni, “Rwoda, wayele dyewor benebene, pe wamako gin mo. Ento pi loki abibolo obwo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Jon 21:6</ref> </char></note> Ka gutimo kitmeno, ci gumako lwak rec mapol ata, ma obwogi ocako cot. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ci gugwelo lumak rec wadgi ma i yeya mukene ni gubin gukonygi. Gubino ci guloko rec i yeya aryo ducu gupong woko, omiyo gucako mwuny. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ka Cimon Petero oneno gin man, ci oryebe piny inyim Yecu, kun waco ni, “Rwot, cit giri, iweka, pien an labalo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Pien en ki dano ducu ma onongo gitye kwede guuru pi rec ma gumako. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yakobo ki Jon lutino pa Jebedayo, ma gin yam ribe ki Cimon i dog tic, bene guuru. Yecu owaco bot Cimon ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ilwor; cake koni dong i bimako dano.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ka dong gukelo yeyagi iwi tera, ci guweko jamigi ducu gulube.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango kom ladobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ikare ma onongo tye i taun madit mo, dano mo obino ma dobo orwato ikome. Ka en oneno Yecu, ci oryebe piny olege ni, “Ladit, ka in imito, itwero canga.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yecu oryeyo cinge ogudu kome, kun wace ni, <char style="wj">“Amito; komi ocang.”</char> Cutcut dobo ocang ki ikome. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref> </char></note> Yecu ocike ni pe myero otit bot dano mo; ento ni, <char style="wj">“Citi, inyute keni bot ajwaka pa Lubanga, dok imii gityer pi komi madong ocang woko ni, kit mayam Moses ociko pire, wek obed lanyut botgi ni in dong icang.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ento pire oywek matek makato, lwak mapol ocoke ka winye dok wek ocang gi ki ikom twogi. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ento Yecu yam lwite kare ki kare cito kalega i tim.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano ma twoyo two akweya kom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Inino mo acel onongo Yecu tye ka pwony, kun Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik ma gua ki ikin gangi ducu me Galilaya ki Judaya ki Jerucalem gubedo kunu; tek pa Rwot me cango dano onongo tye ikome. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Cutcut jo mogo gukelo bote lagoro mo ma twoyo two akweya kom, ma obutu iwi kitara. Guyenyo yo me tere i ot wek kikete inyim Yecu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ento ma pe gunongo yo, pi pol pa lwak, guito iwi ot, guelo wi ot ci gucwale ki kitarane i dye ot inyim Yecu. <figure style="fig" alt="They went up on the roof and let him down with his bed through the tiles" file="4300519.TIF" size="col" copy="Ann Vollton" ref="5:19">Gucwale ki kitarane ki ikin matangula</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ka Yecu oneno niyegi, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Larema, bali dong kiweko woko.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo gucako penye keken gi, kun giwaco ni, “Man anga ma loko lok me yeto Lubangani? Anga matwero weko bal, kono Lubanga keken?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ka Yecu oniang penygi, ci odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wutye ka penye kitmeno icwinywu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" /><char style="wj">Mene ma yot, me waco ni, ‘Bali dong kiweko,’ nyo ni, ‘Aa, iwoti’?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" /><char style="wj">Ento meno wek wunge ni Wod pa dano tye ki twero me weko bal iwi lobo,”</char> ci ociko lagoro ni, <char style="wj">“Awaci ni, a, ikwany kitarani, idok paco.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Cutcut lagoro oa malo ocung inyimgi, ci okwanyo gin ma onongo obutu iye odok paco kun pako Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Dano ducu guuru matek tutwal, gupako Lubanga. Lworo omakogi, guwaco ni, “Waneno gin me aura tin.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olwongo Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ka man otum, ci Yecu okato woko, oneno lajog mucoro mo ma nyinge Levi, kun obedo piny i ka jogo mucoro; ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Luba.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Levi oweko jamine ducu, oa olubu kore.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ci Levi otedo karama madit i ode pi Yecu, lwak lujog mucoro mapol ki jo mukene gubedo piny i dog cam kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref> </char></note> Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik gungur ikom lupwonyene, kun gipenyo ni, “Pingo wucamo dok wumato kacel ki lujog mucoro ki lubalo?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Jo ma komgi yot pe gimito daktar; ento jo ma komgi lit aye gimito.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" /><char style="wj">An pe abino kalwongo jo ma kitgi atir, ento lubalo, wek gunguti.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom lok me rii kec</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Guwace ni, “Lupwonye pa Jon girii kec kare ki kare, dok gilego bene, ki pa Luparicayo bene kitmeno, ento lupwonyeni gicamo dok gimato do.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutwero miyo wele pa lanyom rii kec ma kun lanyom tye kwedgi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" /><char style="wj">Ento kare bibino ma ka kikwanyo lanyom woko ki botgi, ka dong gibirii kec ikare meno.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yecu dok obolo botgi carolok ni, <char style="wj">“Pe tye ngat mo ma yeco kiraka ki ikom ginaruka manyene woko, ci dabo ikom ginaruka ma otii; ka otimo kitmeno, ci nongo oyecu ginaruka manyeni woko, dok bene kiraka ma ikom manyeni pe birwate ki ma otii ni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" /><char style="wj">Dok pe tye ngat mo ma piko kongo bwino manyen i opiru macon; ka opiko, ci kongo bwino biyeco opiru woko, opiru bene bibale.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" /><char style="wj">Ento kongo bwino manyen myero kipik i opiru manyen bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" /><char style="wj">Pe tye ngat mo ma ka omato kongo bwino macon ci dok mito manyene, pien waco ni, ‘Macon ni mit.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Lapeny ma mako ceng Cabit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nwo 23:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Inino mo acel ka Yecu onongo owoto kun ngolo ki i poto ngano i ceng Cabit. Lupwonyene gurito wit ngano, gutinyo i cinggi, ci gubedo ka mwodone. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ento jo mogo ikin Luparicayo gupenyogi ni, “Pingo wutimo gin ma cik okwero ni pe kiti i ceng Cabit?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Cam 21:1-6</ref></char></note> Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun pe wukwano gin ma nene Daudi otiyo ce, ka nene kec oneke, en ki jo ma onongo gitye kacel kwede?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">En odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci ocamo mugati ma kiketo inyim Lubanga, mayam cik okwero ni dano mo pe ocam, kono ajwaki pa Lubanga keken, dok omiyo mogo bene bot jo ma onongo en tye kwede.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wod pa dano aye Rwot me Cabit.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Labade otal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />I ceng Cabit mukene Yecu odonyo i kacoke, ci opwonyo; kunu onongo tye iye dano mo ma bade ma lacuc otal. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo gukiye ka ce en bicange i ceng Cabit, wek giyeny yo mo me kelo kop ikome. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ento Yecu ongeyo tamgi woko, ci owaco bot labade otal ni, <char style="wj">“Bin icung kany.”</char> Ci danonu oa, ocung kunu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Apenyowu ni, i ceng Cabit cik ye ni kitim iye gin maber, nyo gin marac, kilaro iye kwo nyo kityek woko?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Olworo wange ikomgi ducu, ci owaco bot danonu ni, <char style="wj">“Rye badi.”</char> Ci labade otal oryweyo bade, ci bade ocang. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ento kiniga omakogi matek, guporo lok ikin gi keken gi, pi gin ma myero kitim ikom Yecu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oyero Lukwena apar wiye aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ikare meno Yecu ocito iwi got kalega; ci obedo kalego Lubanga dyewor benebene. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ka piny oru, en olwongo lupwonyene bote, ci oyero jo apar wiye aryo ki ikin gi, omiyogi nying ni gin lukwena; gin ene: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Cimon ma en ocako nyinge ni Petero, ki Anderiya ma omine, Yakobo ki Jon, Pilipo ki Bartolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo ki Tomaci, Yakobo wod pa Alipayo, Cimon ma kilwongo ni Jealot (en nene obedo ngat mamito locken), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Juda wod pa Yakobo, ki Juda me Keriot, mayam oloke odobe.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu opwonyo dok ocango dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ikare ma Yecu lor kwedgi piny, ci ocung kama olaane. Lwak ki lupwonyene mapol onongo gitye kunu, ki lwak dano mapol ma gua ki i Judaya ki i Jerucalem ki i dog nam me Turo ki Cidon. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Gin gubino pi winyo pwonye, dok wek ocanggi woko ki ikom twogi. Ci jo ma cen maracu onongo bene yelogi gucang. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ci lwak ducu gubedo kayenyo yo me gudu kome, pien onongo tek tye a ki ikome pi cango gin ducu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yomcwiny ki cwercwiny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yecu oilo wange bot lupwonyene, ci owaco botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">“Wutye ki gum wun jo ma lucan i lok me cwiny,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">pien ker pa Lubanga mewu!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />
    <char style="wj">Wutye ki gum, wun jo ma kec nekowu kombedi, pien wubiyeng!</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">Wutye ki gum, wun jo ma wukok kombedi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">pien wubinyero!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Wutye ki gum ka dano dagwu, kace kiryemowu woko ki ikin gi, ka kiyetowu, ka kicayo nyingwu ni rac, pi Wod pa dano!</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Tek 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Tic 7:52</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Cwinywu obed yom inino meno, kun wupye ki yomcwiny, pien mot ma kibimiyowu me pwoc dit, tye i polo; pien kwarigi yam gutimo lunebi kitmeno.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ento wubineno can, wun lulonyo pien dong wutyeko gamo gin maber me kweyo cwinywu!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun jo ma yeng kombedi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">pien kec binekowu!</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun jo ma nyero kombedi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">pien wubikumu, dok wubikok!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />
    <char style="wj">Wubineno can, ka dano ducu pwoyowu, pien kwarigi yam gupwoyo lunebi ma lugoba kitmeno.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />
    <char style="wj">Ento wun jo ma winyo, awaco botwu ni, wumar lukworwu, wutim ber bot jo ma dagwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" /><char style="wj">Wuleg gum ikom jo ma cenowu, wuleg pi jo ma nywarowu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma odongo lemi tungcel, loke tungcel bene; ngat ma omayo kanyini, pe itwone koti bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" /><char style="wj">Mi bot dano ducu ma legi; ngat ma omayo jami ni, pe ipeny pi jaminu doki ki bote.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Kit ma wumito dano gutimwu, wun bene wutimgi kumeno!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />
    <char style="wj">Ka wumaro dano mamarowu keken, pwoc ango ma wulimo iye? Pien lubalo bene maro jo mamarogi!</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" /><char style="wj">Ka wumito ber bot dano ma timowu ber, pwoc ango ma wubilimo iye? Pien lubalo bene gimito kitmeno!</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" /><char style="wj">Dok ka wumiyo banya bot dano ma wugeno ni gitwero culuwu, pwoc ango ma wulimo iye? Lubalo bene miyo banya bot lubalo wek guculgi marom.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" /><char style="wj">Ento wun wumar lukworwu, wutimgi ber, wumii banya, kun pe wugeno ni kibiculuwu, ci mot me pwoyowu bibedo madwong, dok wubibedo lutino pa En Mamalo Twal; pien en timo ber bot jo ma pe pwoye ki bot jo maracu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" /><char style="wj">Wubed lukica kit macalo Wonwu bene lakica.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom jo mukene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <char style="wj">“Pe wungolkop ikom jo mukene, wek wun bene pe kingolkop ikomwu; pe wungolkop oloo jo mukene, wek wun bene pe kingolo kop olowu. Wutim kica bot dano pi balgi, ci wun bene kibiweko balwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" /><char style="wj">Wumii, ci kibimiyowu bene. Ci wubinongo gin mabeco ma kipimo maber, ma kidilo, ma kiyengo, ma o. Pien kit ma wutero kwede ki dano en aye bene kit ma Lubanga biterowu kwede.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Ci Yecu obolo botgi carolok man. Kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Latowang pe twero peyo latowang lawote? Gin aryo ducu gibipoto woko i bur?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jon 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Lapwonye pe dit kato dano ma pwonye; ento dano ducu ka dong kipwonyogi maber, gibidoko macalo lapwonygi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" /><char style="wj">Pingo ineno cung kal matye iwang omeru, ento dul yat matye i wangi in kikomi pe ineno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" /><char style="wj">Nyo itwero waco bot lawoti ningning ni, ‘Lawota, wek akwany cungkal matye i wangini woko,’ kun in kikomi pe ineno dul yat matye i wangi? In labwolo, kong ikwong kwanyo dul yat matye i wangini woko, ci miyo dong ineno piny maber me kwanyo cung kal matye iwang lawoti ca.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yat maber kingeyo ki ikom nyige</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />
    <char style="wj">“Pien pe tye yat maber matwero nyako nyige maracu; ki yat marac bene pe twero nyako nyige mabeco.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Yat acel acel ki ngeyo ki nyige. Pe kipwono olam ki ikom okutu oryang, dok bene pe kipwono olok ki ikom ocok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Dano maber kwanyo gin maber ki ikin jami mabeco ma en okano i cwinye, dano marac kwanyo gin marac ma ikin jami maracu ma en okano, pien dog dano loko gin ma opong i cwinye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lugedo aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <char style="wj">“Pingo wulwonga ni, ‘Rwot, Rwot,’ kun pe wutiyo gin ma acikowu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" /><char style="wj">Dano mo keken ma bino bota ma winyo loka, dok tiyo ki loka, abinyutu botwu ngat ma en cal kwede.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" /><char style="wj">En bedo rom ki dano ma ogero ot ma okwinyo matut, ma ocibo gutine ikom pata got; ka pii opong, ci lalele ocore ikom ote, ento pe otwero yengone, pien kigero maber.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" /><char style="wj">Ento dano ma winyo loka kun pe tiyo kwede, rom ki dano ma ogero ote i ngom labongo guti; ka kulu omol ki tek ikome, ci opoto oyotoyot, oganye woko piny lirubuku!”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latic pa ladit maloyo acikari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ka Yecu dong otyeko tito loke ducu bot dano, ci en odonyo i Kapernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ladit mo ma Laroma maloyo wi acikari miya yam tye ki latice ma en maro tutwal, ma kome lit, cok to. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ka en owinyo pi Yecu, ci ooro ludongo pa Lujudaya bote kun lege ni obin ocang latice. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ka gubino bot Yecu, ci gubako dogi bote ki cwinygi ducu kun giwace ni, “Laco man obedo dano ma kite ber mada, myero ikonye, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />pien maro rokwa, en aye ogero ot me kacokewa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yecu ocito kacel kwedgi. Ka dong oo cok ki gang, ladit maloyo acikari ooro lureme bote, kun wace ni, “Ladit, pe icane, pien an pe amyero me wek ibin idony i oda, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />an aye gin ma omiyo atamo, ni kadi wa an bene pe aromo bino boti. Ento wac lok awaca keken ci latica bicang. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />An bene abedo dano ma kiloya i dog tic, dok kiketa bene atye ki acikari mukene ma an aloyogi. Ka awaco bot acikari mo acel ni, ‘Cit,’ ci cito, dok ka awaco bot ngat mukene ni, ‘Bin’, ci bino dok ka awaco bene bot opiina ni, ‘Tim man,’ ci timo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ka Yecu owinyo lok man, ci ouru tutwal, oloke bot lwak malube, owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Atito botwu ni, peya anongo niye marom ki man, kadi i Icrael.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ka jo ma kiorogi dong gudok paco, ci gunongo latic dong kome yot.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocero wod pa dato i Nain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 5:21-24">Mar 5:21-24</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 5:35-43">35-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:1-44">Jon 11:1-44</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1 Luk 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:32-37">2 Luk 4:32-37</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka kare okato manok, Yecu ocito i taun madit ma kilwongo Nain; lupwonyene ki lwak madwong guwoto kacel kwede. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ka dong onyiko cok ki dogcel me gang kal me taun madit, ci nen, onongo gitye ka lebo dano ma oto, latin ma mine onongo onywale en kene, mine yam dato. Lwak dano ma gua ki i gang kal madit meno onongo gitye kacel kwede. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ci ma Rwot onene, kica omake ikome, owace ni, <char style="wj">“Wek koko obedi.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />En obino ogudu kitara, kun jo ma gitye ka lebo lato gucung mot. Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Awobi, awaci ni, a malo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Dano ma otoni oa, obedo, ocako lok. Ci Yecu omiye bot mine. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Lworo omakogi ducu, gupako Lubanga kun giwaco ni, “Lanebi madit dong onen ikinwa!” Dok ni, “Lubanga dong olimo jone!” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Lok man ma en otiyoni oywek i lobo Judaya ducu ki i lobo ducu ma orumu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma Jon Labatija ooro bot Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Lupwonye pa Jon gutito bote lok magi ducu. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Ci Jon olwongo jo aryo ki ikin lupwonyene oorogi bot Rwot ka penye ni, “In aye ngat ma myero obin ni, nyo dok wakur ngat mukene?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ka jonu gubino bot Yecu, guwace, ni, “Jon oorowa boti, kun penyo ni, ‘In aye i ngat ma myero obin ni, nyo dok wakur ngat mukene?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ikare meno onongo Yecu ocango lutwo mapol ma gitye ki arem ki cen, omiyo lutowang mapol bene guneno piny. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Ica 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Ica 61:1</ref> </char></note> Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucitit bot Jon gin ma wuneno ki ma wuwinyo; lutowang wanggi oyabe guneno piny, lungolo guwoto, ludobo kicangogi, ki ludingit guwinyo lok, ki jo ma oto kicerogi woko, ki dok lucan bene kitito botgi lok me Kwena Maber.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Dong dano ma tye ki niyene ikoma Lubanga ma cwinye pe oa woko ki ikoma tye ki gum.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ka dong lukwena pa Jon gudok cen, Yecu ocako lok ki lwak ikom Jon ni, <char style="wj">“Onongo wucito i tim kaneno gin ango? Onongo wucito kaneno lagada ma yamo obedo ka yengone?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" /><char style="wj">Onongo wucito kunu kono kaneno gin ango? Wucito kaneno dano ma oruku bongi mabeco? Nen, jo ma ruku bongi me deyo, dok ma bedo ki jami me wel, gin gibedo i odi pa luker.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" /><char style="wj">Dong onongo wucito kunu kaneno gin ango? Wucito kaneno lanebi mo? Eyo, awaco botwu ni ngat madit makato lanebi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Man aye ngat mayam kicoyo lok ikome ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">‘Nen, acwalo lakwenana otelo nyimi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">ma bigero yoni ma peya nongo in ibino.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />
    <char style="wj">Awaco botwu ni, pe tye dano mo ki ikin jo ma mon onywalogi makato Jon ki dit; ento ngat ma rwome tidi tutwal i ker pa Lubanga aye dit kate.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref> </char></note> Lwak ducu guwinyo lok man, wa lujog mucoro ci guye ni Lubanga opore, pien yam kibatijagi ki batija pa Jon, <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />ento Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik gukwero gin ma Lubanga oyubu pirgi, pien nene pe gulimo batija ki bot Jon.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yecu dok owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Kit gin ango dong ma abiporo ki jo me kare man? Gin calo ango?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" /><char style="wj">Girom ki lutino ma gibedo i cuk ma gilwongo lutino wadigi kun giwaco ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">‘Yam wakutu nyamulere botwu wun pe wumyelo;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">wawero wer lyel, wun pe wukok.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />
    <char style="wj">Pien Jon Labatija dong obino kun bedo i niriikec, dok pe mato kongo bwino bene ci wun wuwaco ni, ‘En tye ki cen.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" /><char style="wj">Wod pa dano obino kun camo cam dok mato mat bene, wun wuwaco ni, ‘Nen, dano ma owor dok lamero, larem lujog mucoro ki lubalo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" /><char style="wj">Ento lutino pa Lubanga kikome guniang ni gin ma wan watiyo obedo tic me ryeko.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu iot pa Cimon ma Laparicayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ngat acel ikin Luparicayo olwonge kacam i paco bote; ci Yecu ocito iot pa Laparicayo obedo piny i dog cam. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jon 12:3</ref> </char></note> Ci onongo tye dako mo ma labalo i taun meno. Ka ongeyo ni Yecu tye kacam iot pa Laparicayo, ci okelo adomo moo ma ngwece kur. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ocung inget Yecu tung kutyene kun kok, ma pig wange ton ityen Yecu, ci obedo ka dunyune ki yer wiye kun noto tyene, ka dok bene owiro ki moonu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ma Laparicayo ma onongo olwongeni oneno, oloko i iye kekene ni, “Kono dano man lanebi, kono oniang ikom dako ma ogudeni, ki kite, ni en labalo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Cimon, atye ki lok mo ma amito awaci.”</char> Cimon ogamo ni, “Waca, Lapwony.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat mo ma lami banya yam tye ki dano aryo ma gudeno banya bote. Ngat acel onongo tye ki banya me denari miya abic, ki ngat mukene pyere abic.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" /><char style="wj">Ka culune oloyogi, ci en otimo kica botgi gin aryo ducu. Mene ikin gi ma bimare makato?” </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Cimon odoke iye ni, “Atamo ni en ma kitimo kica pi wel banya madwongi.” Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Ingolo kakare.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ci oloke bot dako man, ka openyo Cimon ni, <char style="wj">“Ineno dako man? Adonyo i odi, ci pe imiya pii me lwoko tyena, ento en olwoko tyena ki pig wange, ci odunyu ki yer wiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" /><char style="wj">In pe imota kun inoto lema, ento cake ikare ma en adonyo i ot, en pe oweko noto tyena.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" /><char style="wj">In pe iwiro wiya ki moo, ento en owiro tyena ki moo ma ngwece kur.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" /><char style="wj">Pimeno atiti ni, dong kitimo ki en kica pi bale mapolgu ducu, kit ma mar ne madwongi nyutuni; ento ngat ma kiweko bale manok, nyute mar manok bene.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Owaco bot dakonu ni, <char style="wj">“Bali dong kiweko.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Jo ma onongo tye i dog cam gucako lok ikin gi keken gi ni, “Man anga, ma weko balli?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Owaco bot dakonu ni, <char style="wj">“Niyeni olari; wot dong giri ki kuc.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mon mogo guwoto kacel ki Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Kare okato manok, ci Yecu owoto ikin taun madongo ki gangi kun tito dok nyutu lok me Kwena Maber ma mako ker pa Lubanga. Lupwonyene apar wiye aryoni onongo tye kacel kwede, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mat 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mar 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luk 23:49</ref> </char></note> kacel ki mon mogo mayam en ocangogi ikom cen ki ikom two. Maliam ma kilwongo ni Maliam me Magdala, ma cen abiro yam oa woko ki ikome, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Joana dako pa Kuja, lagwok lim pa Kerode, Cucana, ki mon mukene mapol, mayam gikonyo Yecu ki lukwena ki limgi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom laco kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Ka lwak mapol gucoke kacel, kun dano gubino bote ma gua ki i taun madit mapol, ci Yecu oloko i carolok ni, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" /><char style="wj">“Laco kodi ocito ka coyo kodine. Ikare ma en coyo kodi, ci kodi mogo okir i yoo, dano gunyono, winyo me polo bene gubino gucamo woko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir ikom pata; ma gudongo, ci gutwo woko, pien pii peke i tergi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir ikin okutu; okutu odongo kacel kwedgi, ci odiyogi woko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" /><char style="wj">Kodi mukene okir i ngom maber, ci gudongo, gunyak guceko nyiggi ma dodo tyen miya.” </char> Ikare madong oloko lok man, ci odange kun waco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat matye ki it me winyo lokman, owiny.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ikom carolok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ka lupwonyene gupenyo Yecu telok me carolok man, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ica 6:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:21">Jer 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Eje 12:2</ref> </char></note> ci en ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kimiyowu me ngeyo mung me ker pa Lubanga; ento jo mukene kimiyogi i carolok wek ka gineno, pe gunen, dok ka giwinyo, pe guniang tere.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ogonyo te carolok ikom laco kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />
    <char style="wj">“Caroloki tere ene: Kodi aye lok pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" /><char style="wj">Kodi ma opoto i yoo gin aye jo ma winyo lok pa Lubanga; ci lacen Catan bino, kwanyo lok ki i cwinygi woko, wek pe guye, ci pe gilare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" /><char style="wj">Kodi ma gupoto ikom pata got aye jo ma winyo lok pa Lubanga, ci gigamo lok ki yomcwiny; ento pe gitye ki lwitgi, ci giye pi kare manok, ento ikare me omo cwiny gipoto woko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" /><char style="wj">Kodi ma okir ikin okutu, gin aye jo ma winyo lok pa Lubanga, ento ka kare okato, ci tam mapol, ki maro lonyo, ki maro yomcwiny me kwo man diyogi woko, miyo nyiggi pe cek maber.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" /><char style="wj">Kodi ma opoto i ngom maber, gin aye jo ma ka guwinyo lok pa Lubanga, ci gimako matek ki cwiny ma gene ki maber, miyo ginyak nyiggi kun gidiyo cwinygi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mac tara ma kiumu ki aduku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11:33</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Pe tye ngat mo ma cwinyo tara, ci dok umu woko ki aduku, nyo keto ite kitanda, ento kingabo iwi lacib tara, wek jo ma bino i ot gunen dero mac ce.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien pe tye gin mo ma kikano ma pe binen kamaleng, dok pe tye gin mo ma kiumu ma pe kibingeyo, dok ma pe kibiyabo kamaleng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pimeno wugwoke kit ma wuwinyo ki lok; pien ngat ma gin mere mo tye kibimede, ngat ma gin mere mo peke, kibikwanyo woko ki bote kadi wa gin ma en tamo ni etye kwede.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Min Yecu ki omegi Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Mine ki omegine gubino, ento onongo pe gitwero oo bote pi lwak. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Kitite ni, “Meni ki omegini gitye gucung woko, gimito neni.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ento Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Maa ki omegina gin aye jo ma giwinyo lok pa Lubanga, dok gilubu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ojuku yamo ki nam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Inino mo acel ka Yecu odonyo i yeya kacel ki lupwonyene, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wakatu wacitu loka nam tung ca.”</char> Ci gucako kwango yeya; <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />ikare ma gitye ka kwango yeya, ci Yecu onino woko. Yamo ocako kodo matek i dye nam i atura kun twago pii me nam, ma omiyo pii ocako pong i yeya, ci onongo gitye marac! <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ci gucito, gucoye kun giwaco ni, “Rwoda, Rwoda, wabito watum woko do!” Ka Yecu oco, ci ocoko yamo, ki pii me nam ma onongo twage ni; ci yamo opye mot, ki pii nam bene opye mot. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Niyewu tye kwene?”</char> Ci lworo omakogi, dok guuru kun gupenye keken gi ni, “Man kono kit dano ango ni, ma juku yamo ki pii ki twero, ci bene giwinyeni?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dano me Geraca matye ki cen marac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Gubino i lobo pa Lugeraca, ma okeme ki Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ka Yecu okato iwi tera, ci dano mo me taun meno matye ki cen obino bote. Danonu onongo orii pi kare malac ma pe ruku bongo, pe bedo i ot bene, ento bedo mere ikin lyel keken. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ka oneno Yecu, en odange, ci oryebe inyime, owaco ki dwon malongo ni, “Yecu Wod pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal, ilaro ango kweda in? Abako doga boti, pe iyela.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Pien onongo Yecu ociko cen marac ki twero ni oa woko ki ikom danonu. Pien tyen mapol onongo poto ikome. Dok onongo kigwoke agwoka kun kitweye ki nyor ki nyonyo, ento yam turu gin ma kitweye kwede woko, cen ryeme, tere i tim. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Nyingi anga?”</char> Ogamo ni, “Legion”;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8:30 </char> <char style="fk">Legion </char> te loke “Buca” mony. </note> pien cen mapol onongo tye ikome. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Cen gubako dogi bote ni pe ocwalogi ni gicit i bur kapiny. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Lwak opego mapol onongo gitye kacam ikor got kunu. Cen gubako doggi bote ni owek gidony i opego. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Cen gua ki ikom danonu, gudonyo i opego, ci lwak opego gutware ki ngwec nia ki i kor got malo, ci gumuny woko i nam.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ka lukwat guneno gin ma otime, ci guringo, gutero loke i taun madit ki ikin paco. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Dano gucito kaneno gin ma otime, ci gubino bot Yecu, gunongo dano ma cen oa ki ikomeni obedo katyen Yecu, oruku bongo, odoko dano; ci lworo omakogi. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Jo ma guneno gin man gutito botgi kit ma dano meno mayam tye ki cen ikomeni ocang kwede. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo pa Lugeraca ma orumu kunu gulego Yecu ni myero oa woko ki botgi, pien onongo lworo omakogi matek; omiyo Yecu odonyo iyeya, ci oa odok gire oweko lobo meno. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Dano ma cen oa ki ikomeni obako doge bot Yecu ni myero ebed bote; ento Yecu pe oye ocwale woko kun cike ni, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" /><char style="wj">“Dok i paconi, citi itit gin madit ma Lubanga otimo ikomi.”</char> Ci ocito otito ikin taun meno ducu lok madit ma Yecu otimo ikome.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya pa Yairo ki dako ma ogudu dog bongo pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ka Yecu odwogo, lwak gujole ki yomcwiny, pien onongo gin ducu gitye ka kure. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Dano mo obino, nyinge Yairo, ma onongo ladit me kacoke. Ci oryebe piny katyen Yecu, obako doge bote ni obin i ode, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />pien onongo yam tye ki nyare ma onywalo acel keken ma onongo dong cok to; mwaka me dite mito romo apar wiye aryo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ikare ma Yecu tye kawot, lwak odiye. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Dako mo onongo tye kunu mayam onongo twoyo two agobi pi mwaka apar wiye aryo, madong obalo lime ducu ka wilo yat, ento pe otwero cang. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Obino cok inge Yecu, ci ogudu dog ginarukane; cutcut remo ma cwer ocok woko. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yecu openyo ni, <char style="wj">“Anga ma ogudani?”</char> Ma dano ducu gukwero woko, ci Petero ki jo matye kacel kwede, gugamo ni, “Rwoda, lwak orumi woko dyere, kun gidiine ikomi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ento Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ngat mo oguda gire, pien awinyo tek oa woko ki ikoma.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ka dakonu oneno ni pe etwero kane, ci obino kun kome myel, ci oryebe inyime, ka otito inyim lwak ducu gin ma omiyo egude, ki kit ma ecang kwede lawang acel. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Nyara, niyeni ocangi, wot ki kuc.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ikare ma Yecu pud tye kalok, ci dano mo obino ma oa ki i gang madit pa ladit me kacoke, owaco ni, “Nyari dong oto woko, pe dong iyel Lapwony.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ento ka Yecu owinyo, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ilwor, ye ayeya keken, ci en bikwo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ka Yecu obino i ot, ci pe oye ni dano mo odony kwede iot, kono Petero ki Jon, ki Yakobo, ki won latin ki min ne keken. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Dano ducu onongo gitye kakoko kun gikumu pire; ento Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwek koko obedi; pien nyakoni pe oto, ento onino anina.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Gunyere matek, pien gingeyo ni nyakoni dong oto woko. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ento Yecu omako bad latin, olwonge, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Nyako, a malo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ka cwinye odwogo, ci en oa malo oyotoyot, Yecu ociko ni gumiye gin mo me acama. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Lunyodone guuru mada; ento Yecu ocikogi matek ni pe myero gutit pi gin ma otimeni bot dano mo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ooro lupwonyene apar wiye aryo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yecu olwongo lupwonyene apar wiye aryo kacel, ci omiyo botgi tek ki twero ikom cen ducu, ki me cango two. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Ci oorogi katito lok ikom ker pa Lubanga ki me cango lutwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Tic 13:51</ref> </char></note> Ci Yecu ocikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wuwot ki gin mo, kadi ki odoo, kadi opiru, kadi kwon, kadi lim, dok pe wubed ki kanyi aryo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" /><char style="wj">Ot ma wubidonyo iye, wubed kunu, nio ka wubia, me cito woko ki itaun meno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" /><char style="wj">Kama pe kijolowu iye, ka wua ki i taun meno, wuteng apwa tyenwu obed caden botgi.” </char> <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Lukwena gua gucito ikin gang, ci gutito lok me Kwena Maber kun gicango lutwo bene ikabedo ducu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wi Kerode ocung woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento ka Kerode rwot madit me Galilaya owinyo pi gin ducu ma obedo ka time, wiye ocung woko, pien jo mogo guwaco ni Jon Labatija aye ocer ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Jo mukene ni, Eliya aye dong onen, jo mukene ni, ngat acel ikin lunebi macon aye ocer. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Kerode owaco ni, “Jon yam atongo wiye woko do; ento man anga ma dok awinyo lok macalo magi ikomeni?” Ci en obedo kayenyo yo me neno Yecu tutwal.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo cam ki jo alip abic</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jon 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Ka lukwena gudwogo, ci gutite lok ducu ma gutiyo. Ci Yecu oterogi, ocito kwedgi i taun madit ma kilwongo Betecaida i mung. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ka lwak guwinyo, ci gulubu kore, en ojologi, ci otito botgi lok ikom ker pa Lubanga, ci ocango jo ma komgi lit. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ka piny dong mito yutu, ci Lukwenane apar wiye aryo gubino bote, guwace ni, “Cwal lwak gucit ikin gangi ki i paci ma orumu kany, wek guyeny kabutu, gunong cam; pien kany wan watye i dye tim.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ento Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun aye wumii botgi cam.”</char> Ci gugamo ni, “Watye ki mugati abic ki rec aryo keken, nyo kece i mito ni wacit wawil cam pi lwak man ducu?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Pien onongo gimito romo co alip abic. Ci Yecu owaco ki lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Wumii dano gubed piny i dul, i dul acel acel dano obed pyere abic.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Gutimo kumeno, ci gumiyo dano ducu gubedo piny. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yecu okwanyo mugati abic ki rec aryonu, oneno malo i polo, ci olego iye gum, obaro iye, ci omiyo bot lupwonyene wek guket inyim lwak. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Gin ducu gucamo guyeng. Kicoko ngide mudong oromo aduku apar wiye aryo.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero otucu lok ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Inino mo acel ka Yecu onongo tye kalega kakene, kun lupwonyene bene tye kacel kwede, en openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Dano mono giwaco ni an anga?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mar 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref> </char></note> Gudok iye ni, “Jon Labatija, jo mukene giwaco ni Eliya, ki jo mukene ni ngat mo acel ikin lunebi macon aye dong ocer.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jon 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref> </char></note> Ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun kono wuwaco ni an anga?”</char> Petero ogamo ni, “In i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi to ne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ento Yecu ocikogi matek ni pe myero gutit lok man bot dano mo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Dok owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wod pa dano myero okany can madwong, dok ludongo ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik myero gukwere woko, ci guneke, ento myero kicere woko inino me adeke.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok owaco bot dano ducu ni, <char style="wj">“Ka dano mo mito lubu kora, myero okwong kwere kekene, ci oting yatariyane nino ducu, olub ki kora.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Pien dano mamito laro kwone, birwenyone arwenya, ento dano ma rwenyo kwone pira, bilaro kwone.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" /><char style="wj">Pien kit mot ango ma dano mo binongo kace oloyo lobo ducu ento orwenyo nyo obalo kwone woko?</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" /><char style="wj">Dano ma lewic make pira ki pi loka, Wod pa dano bene lewic bimake ikome, ikare ma en bidwogo ideyone ki deyo pa Lubanga Won kacel ki pa lumalaika maleng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" /><char style="wj">Ento atito botwu ni, tye jo mogo ma gucung kany ma pe gibibilo to, ma pud peya guneno ker pa Lubanga.</char><verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kom Yecu oloke mapat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka nino dong okato mamito romo aboro inge lok magi, Yecu otero Petero ki Jon ki Yakobo, oito kwedgi iwi got kalega. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ikare ma onongo en tye kalega, wange oloke mapat, ginarukane bene odoko matar maryeny lidangdang. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ci nen, jo aryo gubedo kalok kwede, jonu onongo gin aye Moses gin ki Eliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Gin gunen kun gitye ki deyo, guloko pi a ne ki i lobo man, ma en myero ocob i Jerucalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petero ki jo matye kacel kwedgi onongo nino omako wanggi matek, ento ma guco woko ki iwang nino, guneno deyone ki jo aryo ma gucung kacel kwedeni. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ka jo aryonu mito a woko ki bote, ci Petero owaco ni, “Rwoda, bedo kany ber; wek wager bolo adek, acel meri, acel pa Moses, ki acel pa Eliya.” Petero onongo pe ngeyo gin ma en etye kaloko. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ikare ma onongo pud en tye kalok, pol obino, ci oumugi woko lipuk; ci lworo omakogi ka gudonyo i pol. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ica 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref> </char></note> Dwon oa ki i polo ni, “Man aye Woda madong ayero; wuwinye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ka dwon man dong otyeko lok, ci gunongo Yecu odong kene. Lupwonyene guling alinga; ikare meno, pe gutito lok mo ikom gin ma guneno bot dano mo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango awobi matye ki cen marac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Orwune, madong gulor piny ki iwi got, lwak madwong gurwate kwede. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Nen, laco acel ki ikin lwak odange ni, “Lapwony, abako doga boti, inen woda, pien anywalo en acel kene. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nen, cen bino ikome, ci miyo kok cut; ci ryeye woko weko jake matek, ci kelo bwoyo idoge, dok nyongo kome woko, ki bene pe a ki ikome oyotoyot. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Abako doga bot lupwonyeni ni guryem woko, ento ryemone oloyogi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun yalwak me kare man, pe wutye ki niye, kitwu pe atir dong obale woko. Abibedo kwedwu wa awene? Abidiyo cwinya pi kit kwowu nio wa awene? Kel wodi kany.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ka awobini onongo tye kabino, cen orete woko piny, oryeye matek. Ento Yecu ogere iwi cen, ocango awobinu, ci odwoke bot wone. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Dano ducu guuru dit pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yecu dok otito pi to ne</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ento ma pud gitye kauru gin ducu ma en otiyo, Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" /><char style="wj">“Wuwek lok man odony i itwu; pien Wod pa dano kibimiye ite twero pa dano.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ento lupwonyene pe guniang lok man; dok lok man okane woko ki botgi wek pe guniang iye; ci gulworo penye pi lok meno.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anga maloyo ki dit?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Pyem yam dok ocake ikin gi, ni anga ma ikin gi ma rwome dit loyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ento ka Yecu ongeyo pyem matye i cwinygi, okwanyo latin matidi, omiye ocung ka ngete. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jon 13:20</ref> </char></note> Ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Dano ducu ma jolo latin man inyinga, nongo ojolo an, dano ducu ma jolo an, nongo ojolo ngat ma oora; pien ngat ma rwome tye tidi tutwal ikinwu ducu en aye obedo ngat rwome tye dit maloyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat ma pe lakworwu tye tung botwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mar 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Jon ogamo ni, “Rwoda, waneno ngat mo ma ryemo cen inyingi, wagenge, pien en onongo pe lubi kacel kwedwa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ento Yecu odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wugenge, pien ngat ma pe lakworwu, nongo tye tung botwu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lucamaria mogo gukwero jolo Yecu i ganggi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ka kare dong mito romo me tinge malo, Yecu omoko tame matek me cito i Jerucalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />En ooro lukwenane mogo gukwongo nyime; ci gucito, gudonyo i taun madit mo ma pa Lucamaria pi yube kabedo. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ento Lucamaria pe gujole, pien guniang ni en dong tye ma okeme me cito i Jerucalem aye pi woro Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Luk 1:9-16</ref> </char></note> Ka lupwonyene Yakobo ki Jon guneno, ci guwaco ni, “Rwot, i mito walwong mac oa ki i polo, otyekgi woko?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ento Yecu oloke, ojukugi. [En owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wungeyo kit cwiny ma wutye kwede;</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" /><char style="wj">pien Wod pa dano pe obino ka tyeko kwo pa dano, ento pi larogi.”</char>] Ci Yecu ki lupwonyene dong gucito i gang mukene.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma onongo gimito lubu Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ka gitye kawot i yoo, dano mo owace ni, “Abilubi kama icito iye ducu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Too tye ki boro, winyo me polo bene tye ki odigi, ento Wod pa dano pe tye ki kama myero opyel iye wiye.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />En owaco bot dano mukene ni, <char style="wj">“Luba.”</char> Ento danonu ogamo ni, “Ladit, kong iwek acit ayik wora.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wek jo ma oto guyik jo ma oto wadigi; ento in icit, inya lok ikom ker pa Lubanga”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Luk 19:20</ref></char></note> Ngat mukene owaco ni, “Abilubi, ladit; ento kong iwek acit, acik jotuwa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Pe tye dano mo ma mako kweri dyang, ka dok neno ngeye, ma biromo bedo ma opore pi tic maber i ker pa Lubanga.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ooro jo pyere abiro i tic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />I nge man, Rwot oyero jo mukene pyere abiro, ci oorogi ki aryoaryo wek gukwong nyime, me cito i taun ducu ki ikabedo ducu kama en kikome obicito iye. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref> </char></note> Ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Poto tye ma cam ocek iye madwong, ento lukac aye nok; pimeno wuleg Won poto, wek ocwal lutic ka kac.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Wucit giwu; nen, acwalowu macalo lutino romi ikin orudi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pe wuwot ki kicaa lim nyo opiru, kadi war; pe wumot ngat mo i wangayo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" /><char style="wj">Ot ducu ma wudonyo iye, wukwong waco ni, “‘Kuc obed iot man.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" /><char style="wj">Ka dano mo me kuc tye kunu, ci kucwu bibedo ikome; ento ka pe, ci kucwu bidwogo botwu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tem 5:18</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Wubed iot meno, kun wucamo dok wumato gin ma kimiyowu, pien latic myero kimiye mucarane. Pe wubed ka kobo iot ki ot.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" /><char style="wj">Ka wudonyo i taun mo, ce kijolowu, ci wucam gin ma kiketo inyimwu;</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" /><char style="wj">wucang lutwo matye iye, wutit botgi ni, “Ker pa Lubanga dong onyiko cok botwu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Tic 13:51</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento ka wudonyo i taun madit mo, ce pe kijolowu, ci wucit i wangayo me gang meno, ci wuwac ni,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" /><char style="wj">“Wa apwa me gangwu ma omoko i tyenwa, watengo ikomwu; kadi bed kitmeno, myero wunge man ni, ker pa Lubanga dong onyiko cok.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aca 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Atito botwu ni, inino meno can pa Codom bibedo tworatwora makato pa taun meno.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom taun ma jo ma iye pe gungut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Ica 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eje 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Jek 9:2-4</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Ibineno can, in Korajin! Ibineno can, in Betecaida! Pien kono yam tic madito ma kitiyo botwu kitiyo i Turo ki Cidon, kono jone gungut wa con, kun giruku bongo cola ma gibedo i buru bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" /><char style="wj">Ento can pa Turo ki Cidon bibedo tworatwora inino me ngolo kop, makato can ma bipoto ikomi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Ica 14:13-15</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ki in Kapernaum, i mito ile woko malo wa i polo ce? Pe kumeno, kibidwoki woko piny i kapiny.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jon 13:20</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Ngat ma winyowu, nongo owinyo an, ngat ma kwerowu, nongo okwero an; ngat ma kwera, nongo okwero ngat ma oora.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano pyere abironu gudwogo cen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Dano pyere abironu gudwogo cen ki yomcwiny, kun giwaco ni, “Rwot, wa cen bene guwinyo cikwa pi nyingi!” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />En odok iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam aneno Catan kun poto piny nia ki i polo macalo lutkot.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Jab 91:13</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Nen, dong amiyowu twero me nyono twol ki oton, ki me loyo tek ducu pa lakwor; gin mo pe bitimowu marac.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed kumeno cwinywu pe obed yom piman ni, cen giwinyo cikwu; ento cwinywu obed yom, pien nyingwu kicoyo iwi polo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu obedo ki yomcwiny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />I cawa meno Yecu obedo ki yomcwiny i Cwiny Maleng kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Apwoyi, Wora, in Rwot me polo ki me lobo, pien ikano lok magi woko ki bot luryeko ki lunge piny, ci inyutugi bot lutino lukere; eyo, Wora, pien onongo ipwoyo kit yo macalo meno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jon 3:35</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:15">Jon 10:15</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Jami ducu dong Wora otyeko miyogi woko bota; ngat mo pe ma ngeyo ni Wod en anga, kono Won keken, dok bene ngat mo pe ma ngeyo ni Won en anga, kono Wod keken, ki ngat ma Wod oyero me nyutu Won bote.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yecu oloke bot lupwonyene, owaco botgi i mung ni, <char style="wj">“Tye ki gum, dano maneno gin ma wun wuneno!</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" /><char style="wj">Pien atitiwu ni, lunebi ki luker mapol yam gugomo me neno gin ma wun wuneno, ento pe guneno, ki me winyo gin ma wun wuwinyo, ento pe guwinyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom Lacamaria maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28">Mar 12:28</ref> </char>
    </note> Nen, ngat mo acel ma Lapwony Cik oa malo, me temo i Yecu kun penye ni, “Lapwony, atim ango wek alim kwo ma pe tum?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ci Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Kicoyo ni ngo i cik? Ikwano ningning?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Nwo 6:5</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref> </char></note> Danonu odok iye ni, “Mar Rwot Lubangani ki cwinyi ducu, ki tipuni ducu; ki teki ducu, ki tami ducu; mar lawoti bene macalo imare keni.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref> </char></note> Yecu ogamo doge ni, <char style="wj">“Idok iye kakare; tim kitmeno, ci ibikwo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ento danonu pi mito loyo kop, openyo Yecu ni, “Anga kono ma obedo Lawota?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye dano mo ma oa ki i Jerucalem, cito piny tung Jeriko, ci orwate ki luyak; gulunyu bongine ki ikome, ci gupwode, gucito, guweke kun dong cok to.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" /><char style="wj">Ci nen, ajwaka pa Lubanga mo onongo bene tye kalubu yoo meno; ka onene, ci obare okato ki i teng yo tung cel.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno Lalevi mo bene ka oo ikabedo meno, onene, ci en bene obare woko okato ki cen.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" /><char style="wj">Ento Lacamaria mo ma onongo bene tye kawot i yoonu, oo ka kama en tye iye. Ikare ma onene, ci kica omake ikome.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" /><char style="wj">Ocito bote, oonyo moo jeituni ki kongo bwino iwang rete, ci otweyo woko. Lacen okete iwi kanane, ci otere i ot welo, wek kigwoke.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" /><char style="wj">Orwone okwanyo lim, omiyo bot ngat ma gwoko ot welo, ocike ni, ‘Twoye; gin ducu ma ibimiyo makato, an abiculi ka adwogo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" /><char style="wj">Anga ikin jo adeki ma itamo ni obedo lawot danoni ma orwate ki luyaki?” </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />En odok iye ni, “Ngat ma otime kicani.” Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“In bene cit, icitim kitmeno.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olimo Marita ki Maliam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jon 11:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Ikare mo ka gitye kawot i yo, ci Yecu odonyo i taun madit mo, ci dako mo ma nyinge Marita ojole i ode. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />En yam tye ki lamine nyinge Maliam, ma obedo katyen Yecu kun winyo pwonye. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ento Marita onongo obedo ka cane ki tic mapol; ci en ocito bot Yecu, openye ni, “Rwot, pe iparo ni lamera oweka atye katic kena? Wac bote wek okonya.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ento Rwot ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Marita, Marita, itye ki par mapol, dok cwinyi bene ongabe pi jami mapol,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" /><char style="wj">ento tye gin acel keken mamite. Maliam oyero dul maber ma pe kibikwanyo woko ki bote.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Pwony pa Yecu ikom lega</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-15">Mat 6:9-15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Yecu onongo yam tye kalega ikabedo mo; kadong otyeko, ci ngat acel ki ikin lupwonyene owace ni, “Rwot, pwonywa ki lega, kit macalo yam Jon opwonyo kwede lupwonyene.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ka wulego, ci wuwac kit man ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">‘Wonwa, kiwor nyingi maleng. Ker meri obin.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />
    <char style="wj">Miwa nino ki nino camwa me nino ducu.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />
    <char style="wj">Iwek balwa, macalo wan ki komwa waweko bal pa dano ducu ma gibalo botwa. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">Pe iterwa i abita.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Dok owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Anga ikinwu matye ki lareme ci bicito bote i cwiny dyewor ka penye ni, ‘Larema, konya ki mugati adek;</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" /><char style="wj">pien larema mo oa i wot, ocora, ci pe atye ki cam mo ma myero aket inyime.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" /><char style="wj">En bidoke iye ki i ot ni, ‘Wek yela; dong acego dogola woko, wan ki lutinona dong wabutu woko; pe atwero a malo ka mini gin mo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" /><char style="wj">Atito botwu ni, kadi bed en pe bia malo ka miye gin mo pi bedo lareme, ento pi dide ci bia, bimiye gin ducu ma en mito.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" /><char style="wj">Dok awaco botwu ni, wulegi, ci kibimiyo botwu; wuyeny, ci wubinongo, wudwong dogola, ci kibiyabo botwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" /><char style="wj">Pien dano ma lego kimiye, ki ngat ma yenyo bene, nongo; ngat ma dwongo dogola bene, kibiyabo dogola bote bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" /><char style="wj">Anga ikinwu ma won latin, ka latine olege ni omiye rec, ci bimiye twol ma kaka rec?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" /><char style="wj">Nyo ka olege ni omiye tong gweno, ci bimiye oton?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" /><char style="wj">Ka wun jo maracu wungeyo miyo mot mabeco bot lutinowu, ci Wonwu matye i polo pe bikatowu, bimiyo Cwiny Maleng makato bot jo ma lege?”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ki Beeljebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mar 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yam onongo Yecu tye ka ryemo cen ki ikom dano mo ma te lebe oto; ka cen dong oa ki ikom dano ma onongo tye ki cen, ma telebe oto ni, en oloko, ci lwak guuru. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref> </char></note> Ento jo mogo ki ikin gi guwaco ni, “En ryemo cen ki twero pa Beeljebul ladit pa cen.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8:11</ref> </char></note> Jo mukene onongo giyenyo lanyut ki bote ma a ki i polo, pi teme. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ento Yecu ongeyo tamgi, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ka ker me lobo mo iye opoke woko aryo, ci ker me lobo meno bale woko; dok bene gang ma jo ote opoke woko pe cung.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" /><char style="wj">Catan bene ka iye opoke woko kun gilwenyo ikin gi, ci kere bicung ningning? Pien wun wuwaco ni aryemo cen ki twero pa Beeljebul.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" /><char style="wj">Ka an aryemo cen ki twero pa Beeljebul, ci lupwonyewu kono giryemo cen ki twero pa anga? Pimeno gin aye gibibedo lungolkopwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" /><char style="wj">Ento kace an aryemo cen ki tek me cing pa Lubanga, ci dong wunge ni ker pa Lubanga dong obino botwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" /><char style="wj">Ka oteka ma oruku jami lwenye ducu tye ka gwoko gang kale, ci jamine ducu bedo labongo ayela.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" /><char style="wj">Ento ka dano matek kate obino olwenyo ikome ce oloye, ci en bicoko jami lwenye mayam en geno ni, dok bipoko jami ma en oyako ki boteni ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9:40</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma pe tung bota, meno nongo en lakwora, dok ngat ma pe nywako kacel kweda ka coko, nongo keto mere aketa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma cen dwogo kwede ikom dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Ka cen dong oa ki ikom dano mo, ci cito wire i tim kama pii pe iye kun yenyo kama ebiywe iye; ento ka nongone oloye woko, ci waco ni, ‘Abidok gira i oda kama yam aa ki iyeni.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" /><char style="wj">Ka obino, ce nongo kiyweyo iot woko maleng, kiyubu maber.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" /><char style="wj">En dok, cito kelo cen mukene abiro ma giracu gikate woko, ci gidonyo gibedo i odeni; lacen danonu bibedo marac makato kit ma onongo yam obedo kwede con.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gum me ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ka Yecu oloko lok man, ci dako mo ki ikin lwak owoto dwone, owace ni, “Tye ki gum ic ma onywali, ki tunu ma idoto!” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ento Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Makatone gitye ki gum, jo ma giwinyo lok pa Lubanga, dok gigwoko!”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipenyo Yecu pi lanyut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar 8:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar 8:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka lwak gumede mapol, ci Yecu ocako waco ni, <char style="wj">“Yalwak pa jo maracu giyenyo lanyut, ento pe kibimiyo botgi lanyut mo, kono lanyut pa lanebi Yona keken.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Yon 3:4</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien kit macalo Yona yam odoko lanyut bot jo Nineve, kitmeno Wod pa dano bene bidoko lanyut bot yalwak me kare man.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Luk 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Tek 9:1-12</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Rwot ma dako matye tung kupiny bicung kacel ki yalwak me kare man ikare me ngolo kop, ci miyo kop loyogi; pien en oa ki i agiki lobo obino kawinyo ryeko pa Solomon, ento nen, gin madit makato Solomon tye kany.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3:5</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Jo Nineve bicung kacel ki yalwak me kare man, ikare me ngolo kop, ci miyo kop loyogi, pien gin yam gungut pi lok ma Yona onongo otito, ento nen, gin madit makato Yona tye kany.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tara me menyo kom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk 8:16</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Pe tye ngat mo ma cwinyo tara ci kano i gul, nyo umu auma ki aduku; ento cibo iwi lacib tara, wek dano ducu ma gibino i ot gunen derone.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" /><char style="wj">Tara me menyo komi aye wangi; kace wangi bal mo pe iye, ci komi kulu bipong ki dero. Ento kace wangi tye ki bal mo ikome, ci komi kulu bipong ki colpiny.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" /><char style="wj">Gwoke wek dero matye i iini pe odok colpiny.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" /><char style="wj">Dong ka komi kulu bedo i dero, kun colpiny pe iye, ci komi kulu bibedo i dero, macalo tara ma menyi ki derune ka tye kalyel.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otucu pi can ma bipoto ikom Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ikare ma Yecu otyeko lok, Laparicayo mo olwonge kacam bote; Yecu odonyo i ot, obedo i dog cam. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Laparicayo ouru ma oneno ni Yecu ocako cam ma pe kong ologo cinge. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ci Rwot owace ni, <char style="wj">“Wun Luparicayo wulwoko nge kikopo ki nge atabo, kun iwu opong ki yak ki tim maracu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" /><char style="wj">Wun lumingming! Pe en Lubanga aceli ma otiyo gin ma tung woko aye bene otiyo gin ma tung iye?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" /><char style="wj">Ento wumii gin ma i atabowu ki i kikopowu bot lucan wek okonygi; ci nen, jami ducu bibedo maleng botwu malube ki kwerwu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Ento wubineno can, wun Luparicayo, pien wumiyo dul me apar me oyado ki ocobo ki kit pot dekwu ducu, kun wuweko ngolo kop atir ki maro Lubanga; meno ducu myero wutim kun pe wuweko magi bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" /><char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Luparicayo, pien wumaro kabedo me dito ikacoke, dok wumito ni dano gumotwu ki woro i cuk.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" /><char style="wj">Wubineno can! Pien wurom ki lyel ma pe ginen ma dano woto iwigi kun pe gingeyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Ngat acel ikin Lupwonycik ogamo doge ni, “Lapwony, ka iwaco kit man nyutu ni iyeto wa wan bene.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik bene! Pien wumiyo dano yeyo yec mapek, ma yeyone tek, kun wun ki komwu pe wukonyo me tingo kadi ki nyig cingwu acel.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" /><char style="wj">Wubineno can, pien wucano got iwi lyel pa lunebi mayam kwariwu guneko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno wun wucaden, wupwoyo tic pa kwariwu, pien gin gunekogi, ka dong wun wucano got iwi lyelgi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" /><char style="wj">Piman Ryeko pa Lubanga owaco ni, ‘Abioro botgi lunebi ki lukwena, jo mogo ikin gi kibinekogi dok bene jo mukene kibilibogi.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" /><char style="wj">Wek kicul kwor pa lunebi ducu ma kinekogi ikom yalwak me kare man pi remo ma kionyo nia i acaki piny.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Aca 4:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Tek 24:20</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 24:21">21</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Kibicako ki ikom remo pa Abel nio kwede wa ikom remo pa Jakaria ma oto ikin keno tyer pa Lubanga ki i Kabedo Maleng. Eyo atito botwu ni, kibiculu kwore ikom yalwak me kare man.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" /><char style="wj">Wubineno can, wun Lupwonycik, pien wumayo layab me ngeyo piny woko, kun wun ki komwu pe wudonyo iye, dok wugengo dano mamito donyo iye bene.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ka Yecu dong oa ki kunu, ci Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo gucako diine matek ma girobo doge ki peny mapol, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />kun gikiye wek gimak lok ma a ki idoge.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Dano myero gugwoke ikom lok buta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar 8:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Ikare meno, lwak dano alip ki alip gucoke kacel, kun dong ginyone keken gi. Mukwongo, Yecu ocako waco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom tobi pa Luparicayo, ma en aye buta.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pe tye gin mo ma kiumu ma pe kibiyabo kamaleng, kadi gin ma kikano ma pe bingene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Pimeno wa lok ducu ma wuloko i colpiny biwinye ilengpiny; dok gin ducu ma wukwilo loke ki i tyelo, kibitito loke ki dwon malongo iwi ot malo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat ma myero dano olwor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />
    <char style="wj">“Lurema, atito botwu ni, pe wulwor jo ma neko kom, ento pe dok gitwero timo gin mo marac makato meno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Ento abinyutu botwu ngat ma myero wulwor: wulwor ngat ma ka dong oneko, ci dok tye ki twero me bolo i Geena; eyo, atito ni, wulwore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" /><char style="wj">Ojwinyojwiny abic pe kicato pi denari aryo keken? Ento pe tye mo acel ikin gi ma wi Lubanga twero wil iye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed wa yer wiwu ducu bene dong kikwanogi woko liweng. Pe wulwor; pien pirwu tek tutwal makato pi ojwinyojwiny mapol.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tucu nying Yecu inyim dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />
    <char style="wj">“Atito botwu ni, dano ducu ma bitucu inyim dano ni giye an, Wod pa dano bene biye gin inyim lumalaika pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" /><char style="wj">Ento ngat ma kwera inyim dano, Wod pa dano bene bikwere inyim lumalaika pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar 3:29</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Dano ducu ma loko lok marac ikom Wod pa dano kibiweko bale; ento ngat ma yeto Cwiny Maleng pe kibiweko bale.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ka kiterowu inyim kacoke ki inyim luloc ki wegi twer, pe wubed ka tamo kit ma myero wulok kwede, nyo ni wubigamo loke ningning, nyo ni kit lok ango ma wubiloko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" /><char style="wj">Pien Cwiny Maleng bipwonyowu icawa meno i gin ma myero wuwaci.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom lalonyo ma laming</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Ngat acel ikin lwak dok owaco bot Yecu ni, “Lapwony, wac bot omera wek wapok ginaleya kwede.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Ento Yecu ogamo doge ni, <char style="wj">“Nyeri, in itamoni anga ma oketo an me bedo langolkop nyo lapok jami ikinwu?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ci Yecu omede ki waco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom miti madwong pi lim; pien kwo pa dano pe cung i wel lim mapol ma en tye kwede.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ka Yecu obolo botgi carolok ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye dano mo ma lalonyo ma cam ocek madwong i potone.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" /><char style="wj">Danonu openye kekene ki i cwinye ni, ‘Abitimo ango, pien pe atye ki kaonyo cama? Dong atimango?’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" /><char style="wj">Dok owaco kekene ni “Abitimo kit man: abimuku derona ducu, ci abigoyo mukene maditone, kama abionyo cama ki jamina ducu i igi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" /><char style="wj">Kadong ‘Abiwaco ki cwinya ni, dano ma lagum kom! Nen, atye ki jami mapol ma biroma pi mwaka mapol ata; abiywe mot, abicam, abimat, abibedo ki yomcwiny.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" /><char style="wj">Ento Lubanga owace ni, “In laming! ‘Idyewor ma tin kibikwanyo kwoni woko ki boti; ka jami ma iyubuni dong bibedo pa anga ce?’” </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Ci Yecu odolo te loke ni, <char style="wj">“Tye kitmeno pi ngat ma kano lonyo pire kene, ma kun pe tye ki lonyo inyim Lubanga.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bed ki gen ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ci Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Pimeno awaco botwu ni, pe wubed ka paro pi kwowu, ni wubicamo ango; nyo pi komwu, ni wubiruku ango.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" /><char style="wj">Pien kwo pire tek kato cam, dok kom pire tek kato ginaruka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" /><char style="wj">Kong wunen mono kit kwo agak; pe gicoyo kodi, dok bene pe gikayo kac, pe gitye ki dula kadi dero, ento Lubanga pitogi. Wun pe wutamoni pirwu tek kato pi winyo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Anga ki ikinwu pi bedo ki par mapol twero medo kare me kwone?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" /><char style="wj">Ka gin manok macalo man timone loyowu, pingo wubedo ki par mapol pi lok mukene?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Luk 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Tek 9:3-6</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Kong wutam pi lenga me tim, kit ma gidongo kwede; pe giwiyo uci, dok bene pe gicweyo bongo. Ento pud amede ki waco botwu ni, kadi bed Solomon yam oruke ki bongo me deyone ducu, ento pe oruke maleng makato mo acel ikin gi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" /><char style="wj">Kace Lubanga ruku lum ma i tim kitmeno, ma bedo tye pi nino ma tin keken, ento diki inongo gibolo woko i keno, ci en pe birukuwu makato, wun jo ma niyewu nok?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" /><char style="wj">Pe wuwek cwinywu obale pi gin ma wubicamo, nyo gin ma wubimato; cwinywu pe obed ka paro lok mapol.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" /><char style="wj">(Pien rok ducu me lobo man yenyo jami magi;) Wonwu matye i polo ngeyo ni wumitogi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" /><char style="wj">Ento ma ka meno, wuket cwinywu ikom ker pa Lubanga, ci jami magi ducu kibimedo botwu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo ma kikano i polo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />
    <char style="wj">“Pe wulwor, wun lutino romi, pien Wonwu cwinye yom atika me miyo ker botwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" /><char style="wj">Wucat jamiwu, wukony ki lucan. Wukwo kicaa lim ma pe tii, wukan lonyo ma pe tum i polo, kama lakwo mo pe oo iye, dok nyenye mo bene pe twero balo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" /><char style="wj">Pien kama lonyowu tye iye, cwinywu bene bedo iye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lutic ma kuru laditgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25:1-13</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Wubed atera ma wutweyo pyerwu kun wuyube bene pi tic, ma tarawu lyel;</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar 13:34-36</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">wubed macalo jo ma kuru ladit ticgi ka bidwogo nia ki i karama me nyom, wek giyabe dogola oyotoyot ka en dong obino dwongo dogcel me gang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" /><char style="wj">Tye ki gum lutic meno ma laditgi ka odwogo nongo peya gunino. Adada awaco botwuni, en biruku bongo me tic, ci biwaco botgi ni gubed piny i dog cam, ci miyogi cam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed ka en obino cwiny dyewor nyo okokgweno, kun onongogi tye ma gutere, lutic meno gitye ki gum.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento myero wunge lok man ni, kace nene won ot ngeyo cawa ma lakwo bibino iye kono okiyo ma pe oweko ngat mo oturu ode.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" /><char style="wj">Ci wun bene myero wubed ma wuyube pien Wod pa dano bibino icawa ma pe wutamo ni en bibino iye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latic ma lagen nyo ma pe lagen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petero openyo ni, “Rwot, ibolo carolok man botwa keken, nyo bot dano ducu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Rwot ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Anga ma lagwok ot ma lagen dok ma laryeko, ma rwode biweko dano ducu ma bedo i ode i teloce, wek opok botgi camgi ikare mamite?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" /><char style="wj">Latic meno tye ki gum, ma ladite ka odwogo binonge kun en tye katiyo tice meno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, ladittu bimiye twero me loyo jamine woko ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" /><char style="wj">Ento ka latic meno oloko kekene ni, ‘Rwoda dong ogale kabino’, ci ocako goyo lutic ma co ki ma mon, kun camo, mato, dok mer,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" /><char style="wj">ladit pa latic meno bidwogo inino mo ma en pe tamo pi dwogone, dok icawa ma en pe ngeyo, ci bipwode, dok bikete ikin jo ma pe gene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" /><char style="wj">Latic meno ma ongeyo gin ma ladite mito, ento pe oyube iye, dok pe olubu gin ma ladite mito, kibipwode ki pwod madit tutwal.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" /><char style="wj">Ento latic ma pe ongeyo gin ma ladite mito, ce otiyo gin matwero miyo kipwode pire, kibipwode manok. Dano ma kimiye madwong, kibimito madwong bene ki bote; dok ngat ma kimiyo mapol bote, kibipenye bene mapol makato.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu okelo apokapoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />
    <char style="wj">“Abino ka cwinyo mac i lobo; kono dong omoko, kono ber!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar 10:38</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Atye ki batija ma myero ki batija an kwede; piman dong atye ki toncwiny nio ka ocobe!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" /><char style="wj">Wun wutamo ni an abino ka kelo kuc i lobo? Pe, atito botwu ni pe akelo kuc; ento apokapoka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" /><char style="wj">Cake tin jo abic ma i ot acel gibibedo kun gupoke; jo adek bikwero jo aryo ki jo aryo bikwero jo adek.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Won latin bipoke woko ki ikom latine, latin bene bipoke woko ki wone; mego bipoke ki nyare, nyako bipoke woko ki mine; dayo bipoke woko ki ciwode, ki ciwod bene bipoke woko ki daa ne.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Niang kit me poko kare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yecu dok owaco bot lwak ni, <char style="wj">“Ka wuneno pol otinge tung kupotoceng, oyotoyot wuwaco ni, ‘Kot koni cwer’; ci cwer bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" /><char style="wj">Dok ka wuneno yamo kodo ki ibut piny tung kupiny, wun wuwaco ni, ‘Piny bibedo lyet matek’, ci time bene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" /><char style="wj">Wun lubuta! Wungeyo poko kin gin manen i lobo ki i polo; pingo pe wungeyo poko kin lanyut me kare man?”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yubu lok ki ngat ma doti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />
    <char style="wj">“Pingo pe wumoko lok matye atir pirwu kenwu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" /><char style="wj">Ka icito bot langolkop kun inywako yoo ki ngat ma doti, teme matek me yubu lok kwede ma pud wutye i yo, pe iwek en oteri inyim langolkop, ci weko langolkop miyi woko bot acikari, ci weko acikari teri iot buc.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" /><char style="wj">Atiti ni, pe ibikati woko ki kunu nio ka iculu cul ducu ma wi cente mo pe orem.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ka pe wungut pi balwu, ci wun ducu wubito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ikare meno onongo tye jo mogo kunu ma gutite pi Lugalilaya mogo mayam Pilato orubu remogi ki gitumgi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Ci Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wutamo ni Lugalilaya meno gin lubalo makato Lugalilaya mukene ducu, ma omiyo guneno can kitmenoni?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" /><char style="wj">Atito botwu ni pe; ento ka pe wungut, ci wun ducu wubito kitmeno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" /><char style="wj">Nyo jo apar wiye aboro meno mayam ot ma wiye bor opoto ikomgi onekogi i Ciloam, wutamo ni gin onongo gutimo bal makato jo mukene ducu ma bedo i Jerucalem?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" /><char style="wj">Atito botwu ni pe; ento ka pe wungut, ci wun ducu wubito kitmeno.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom oduru ma pe nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yecu obolo botgi carolok ni: <char style="wj">“Yam tye dano mo ma onongo tye ki yat oduru ma kipito i poto oloke. En obino i tere kun yenyo nyige, ento pe onongo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Owaco bot lapur ni, ‘Nen, kombedi dong odoko mwaka adek kun abino, ayenyo nyig oduru man, pe anongo. Tong woko; pingo balo ngom nono?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" /><char style="wj">Ento lapur odoke iye ni, ‘Ladit, kong iwek obed pi mwaka man doki, nio ka abako ngom i tere, kun aony iye cet dyang mutwo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" /><char style="wj">Ka binyak i mwaka ma binoni, ci ber; ento ka ce pe, ci ibitongo giri.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango dako ma cen ogomo i ceng Cabit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Yam ka Yecu onongo tye ka pwony ikacoke mo i ceng Cabit. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Dako mo onongo tye kunu matye ki cen ma okelo goro ikome pi mwaka apar wiye aboro; onongo dong ogome woko, ma pe twero tire. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ka Yecu onene, ci olwonge, kun wace ni, <char style="wj">“Dako, kigonyi woko ki ikom goroni.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ci Yecu oketo cinge ikome; cutcut dakonu otire, ci opako Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9">Nia 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Nwo 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref> </char></note> Ento kiniga omako ladit me kacoke, pien Yecu ocango dano i ceng Cabit. Ci owaco bot lwak ni, “Tye nino abicel ma myero kitii iye tic; wubin inino meno wek kicangwu, pe i ceng Cabit.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Rwot odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Wun lubuta! Ngat acel acel ki ikinwu pe gonyo twon ne nyo kanane ki i kacamgi, ci tero i pii i ceng Cabit?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" /><char style="wj">Dako man, ma en nya pa Abraim, mayam Catan otweye pi mwaka apar wiye aboro kulu, pe myero kigonye ki i twec man i ceng Cabit?” </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ikare ma Yecu oloko lok man, ci lewic omako lukwore ducu; lwak ducu cwinygi obedo yom pi tic me aura ducu ma en otiyo.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom kodi karidali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Pimeno en owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ker pa Lubanga rom ki gin ango? Abiporo ki gin ango?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" /><char style="wj">Rom ki kodi karidali ma dano mo okwanyo, ocoyo i potone; ci odongo, odoko yat madit, winyo me polo gibino gigero odigi i jange.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom tobi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Dok owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Abiporo ker pa Lubanga ki gin ango?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" /><char style="wj">Rom ki tobi ma dako mo okwanyo, orubu ki moko mugati maromo adita adek, nio ka moko ducu oyenyu, okwot.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dogola mading</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yecu omede ki wote ikin i taun madito ki gangi, kun pwonyo lwak, dok kwede tung Jerucalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Ngat mo openye ni, “Rwot, jo manok aye mono bilare?” Yecu owaco botgi ni, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" /><char style="wj">“Wuket tek wek wudony ki i dogola mading; pien awaco botwu ni, jo mapol gibiteme me donyo, ento pe gibitwero.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" /><char style="wj">Won ot dong bia malo cego dogola ot woko, ci wun wubicung ki woko ka wudwongo dogola kun wuwaco ni, ‘Ladit, yabiwa dogola ba!’ En bidok iye botwu ni, ‘An pe angeyo kama wua iye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" /><char style="wj">Ci wun wubiwaco ni, ‘Yam wacamo dok wamato kacel kwedi, dok bene ipwonyo dano i dye bomawa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Jab 6:8</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento en biwaco botwu ni, ‘Awaco botwu ni, pe angeyo kama wua iye; wua woko ki inyima, wun lutim maracu ducu!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Kunu wubikok dok wubikayo lakwu, ka wuneno Abraim ki Icaka ki Yakobo ki lunebi ducu kun gitye i ker pa Lubanga, ento wun ki komwu kibolowu woko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mat 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Dano gibibino kun gia ki tung kunyango, ki tung kupotoceng, ki yo tung kumalo, ki tung kupiny, ci gibibedo piny i dog cam i ker pa Lubanga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10:31</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Nen, jo mogo ma guo lacen gibibedo me ati, ki jo mogo me ati gibibedo me lacen.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu okok pi Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />I cawa meno luparicayo mogo gubino, ci guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Aa woko ki kany, pien Kerode mito neki.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit, wuwac bot too ca ni, ‘Nen, abiryemo cen dok abicango dano tin ki diki, inino me adeke abicobo dog tica.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed kitmeno, myero amede gira ki wota, tin ki diki ki dikimaca; pien lanebi pe myero oto ka mukene ma pe i Jerucalem.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" /><char style="wj">Jerucalem, Jerucalem, in ma ineko lunebi, ma icelo jo ma kioro boti woko ki gotti, tyen adii ma nene amito coko lutinoni woko, macalo min gweno coko lutinone ite bwome, ento in pe iye giri!</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Jab 118:26</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Nen, dong kibitenyo otti woko niyak. Dok atito boti ni, pe ibinena nio ka ibiwaco ni, ‘Kipwo ngat ma bino inying Rwot.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latwo akwota kom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Iceng Cabit mo acel, ka Yecu ocito kacam i ot pa laloc mo ma Laparicayo, kun jo mogo gubedo ka kiye mot. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Dano mo ma twoyo two akwota kom onongo tye inyime. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Ci Yecu openyo Lupwonycik ki Luparicayo ni, <char style="wj">“Cik ye ni kicang dano iceng Cabit, nyo pe?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ento guling alinga mot ma pe giwaco gin mo. Yecu omako latwoni, ci ocange, ka dong ocike ni ocit gire. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12:11</ref> </char></note> Ci openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Anga ikinwu ma ka tye ki kanane nyo twone ka opoto iwang it matut ci pe biywayone woko cutcut iceng Cabit?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ento dok ilok meno oloyogi woko.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony bot welo ki bot lalwongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Ka Yecu oneno kit ma dano ma kilwongogi giyero ki kabedo mabeco, ci obolo botgi carolok man ni, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Car 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">“Ka kilwongi i karama me nyom, pe icibed ikabedo mabere me rwom mamalo; gwok nyo kilwongo bene dano dit makati,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" /><char style="wj">ci lalwong wun aryonu ducu bibino boti ci biwaco ni, ‘Wek kabedo ki dano man.’ Kadong ibidok ikabedo mapiny ki twon lewic madit.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" /><char style="wj">Ento ka kilwongi, cit ibed ikabedo mapiny, wek ka dano ma olwongi obino en biwaco boti ni, ‘Larema, kob malo iwi komi’, ci i bibedo ki deyo inyim dano ducu ma wubedo kwedgi i dog cam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk 18:14</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien ngat ma kete kene ni edit, kibidwoke piny, ento ngat ma mwole kene kibimiye doko dit.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ci dok owaco bene bot dano ma olwonge ni, <char style="wj">“Ka ilwongo dano i cam me dyeceng nyo me otyeno, pe ilwong luremi, nyo omegini, nyo watti, nyo lulonyo ma bedo cok ka ngeti; weko gin bene gilwongi, wek gicul wang lwongoni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" /><char style="wj">Ento ka itedo karama, lwong lucan, lungolo, jo ma komo, ki lutowang,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" /><char style="wj">ci i bibedo ki gum, pien pe gitwero culu wang lwongoni. Ci Lubanga biculi ikare ma jo ma kitgi atir bicer iye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom karama madit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ka ngat acel ma gubedo kwede i dog cam owinyo lok man, ci owaco bot Yecu ni, “Tye ki gum dano ma bicamo kwon i ker pa Lubanga!” <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Ento Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Dano mo yam otedo karama madit, en olwongo jo mapol iye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" /><char style="wj">Ka kare me karama oromo, ci en ooro latice ka poyo wi jo ma kilwongogi ni, ‘Wubin, pien dong kiyubu jami ducu.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" /><char style="wj">Ento gin ducu gucako bako dogi ni kitim kica botgi. Ngat mukwongo owace ni ‘Awilo poto, myero acit ka nenone alegi itima kica.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" /><char style="wj">Dano me aryo owaco ni, ‘Awilo twoni apar me pur, acito ka ngiyogi, alegi itima kica.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" /><char style="wj">Ngat mukene owaco ni, ‘Pud anyomo dako anyoma nyen, pimeno pe atwero bino.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" /><char style="wj">Laticu odwogo otito bot rwode kitmeno. Kiniga omako won ot, ci owaco ni, ‘Cit oyotoyot i wangayo, ki ikin gang, icikel lucan, luput, lutowang ki jo ma lungolo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" /><char style="wj">Ci latic owaco ni, ‘Ladit, watimo gin ma iciko, ento kabedo gire pud tye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" /><char style="wj">Ladit owaco bot laticenu ni, ‘Cit igudu madito ki i yo lum, icuk cwiny dano ki tek wek gudony i ot, wek oda opong.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" /><char style="wj">Dong atito botwu ni, pe tye ngat mo ikin jo mayam kilwongogi me bino ma bibilo karamana.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jami ma dano jalo pi lubu Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lwak mapol guwoto kacel ki Yecu, ci Yecu oloke botgi kun waco botgi ni, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">“Ka ngat mo obino bota, ma kun pud peya okwero wone ki mine, dakone ki lutinone, omegine ki nyimegine, kadi wa kwone kikome, ci en pe twero bedo lapwonyena.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma pe tingo yatariyane, kun luba, pe twero bedo lapwonyena.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" /><char style="wj">Pien anga ikinwu ka mito gero ot ma wiye bor, ci pe kong kwongo bedo piny ka kwano wel lim mamite, kace etye kwede ma eromo tyekone?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" /><char style="wj">Ka pe kumeno, miyo ka ocibo guti, matyekone oloye woko, ci dano ducu ma gibineno gibicako ngale,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" /><char style="wj">kun giwaco ni, ‘Dano man ocako gedo, ento tyekone oloye woko.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" /><char style="wj">Nyo rwot mene, ma obicito i mony kalweny ki rwot mukene, ma pe kong bedo piny poro lok, kace etwero tero dano alip apar me romo ki jo alip pyere aryo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" /><char style="wj">Ka pe kumeno, ci en bicwalo kwena bot rwot ca ma pud tye kamabor, wek openy pi gin ma miyo giribe kwede ki kuc.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ikit yo acelu, Yecu odolo te loke ni, <char style="wj">“Kitmeno, dano ducu ma ikinwu ma iye pe twero jalo jami ducu ma etye kwede, pe twero bedo lapwonyena.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kado atwona mabot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />
    <char style="wj">“Kado atwona ber; ento ka dong odoko bot ci kibitimo ningning wek dok odok mit?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" /><char style="wj">Pe dong ber me aketa i poto, dano gibolo woko ata. Ngat matye ki it me winyo lok, owiny.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom romo ma orwenyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:10-14">Mat 18:10-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29">Luk 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref> </char>
    </note> Lujog mucoro ki lubalo onongo yam ginyiko cok kawinyo lok pa Yecu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ci Luparicayo ki Lupwonycik gungur ikom Yecu kun giwaco ni, “Dano man jolo lubalo dok camo kwedgi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Lok man omiyo Yecu obolo botgi carolok man ni, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" /><char style="wj">“Anga ikinwu matye ki romi miya acel, ka ngat acel ikin gi orwenyo, pe biweko romi pyere abongwen wiye abongwen i olet, ci cito kayenyo en ma orwenyoni, nio wang ma ononge?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" /><char style="wj">Ka ononge, ci bolo iwi gwoke, ki yomcwiny.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" /><char style="wj">Ka oo paco, lwongo lureme ki luwote kacel, ci waco botgi ni, ‘Cwinywu obed yom kacel kweda, pien dong anongo romona mayam orwenyoni.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno atito botwu ni, bibedo me yomcwiny madit tutwal iwi polo ikom labalo acel ma ongut, makato ikom jo pyere abongwen wiye abongwen ma kitgi atir ma pe mite ni gunguti.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom cente ma murweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />
    <char style="wj">Nyo dako mene, matye ki ciling ma nyige me ryal gin apar, kace nyige acel opoto orwenyo woko ci pe bicwinyo mac tara, ci yweyo ot kun yenyo matek nio wang ma onongo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" /><char style="wj">Ka dong onongo, ci lwongo lureme ki luwote kacel, kun waco botgi ni, ‘Cwinywu obed yom kacel kweda, pien dong anongo ciling mera ma onongo orwenyoni.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno atito botwu ni, bibedo yomcwiny inyim lumalaika pa Lubanga ikom labalo acel ma ongut.”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom awobi murweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yecu dok omede ki lok kun owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye dano mo matye ki awobene aryo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" /><char style="wj">Matidine owaco bot wone ni, ‘Aba, miya dul lim ma ka mera.’ Ci won gi opoko lime ikin gi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" /><char style="wj">Lacen ka nino okato manoknok, awobi matidini ocoko jamine ducu, ci ocako wote me cito i lobo kamabor; ci obalo lime kunu pi bedo ki kwo me carocaro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" /><char style="wj">Ikare ma lime dong otum ducu, ci kec laparanat opoto i lobo meno matek, ci awobinu ocako mal ata.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" /><char style="wj">Ocito odak bot ngat mo ma i lobo meno; danonu ocwale kagwoko opego.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" /><char style="wj">Cwinye ocako gomo cam ma opego camo; pe tye ngat mo ma omiye gin acama mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" /><char style="wj">Ento ka wiye ocako tic pire kene, ci owaco ni, ‘Lutic pa wora gitye mapol ata ma gicamo kwon loyogi aloya, ento an kono atye ka to ki kec kany!’</char> <figure style="fig" alt="The prodigal son suffers hunger" file="4301517.TIF" size="col" copy="Ann Vollton" ref="15:17">Awobi murwenyoni tye kaneno can pi kec ma neke</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" /><char style="wj">Abi a, adok cen bot wora, ci abiwace ni, ‘Aba, dong abalo inyim Lubanga ki inyimi;</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" /><char style="wj">dong pe amyero me alwonga ni an a wodi; loka abed macalo ngat acel ikin lutici.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" /><char style="wj">Ci oa obino bot wone. Ento ka onongo en pud tye cen kamabor, wone onene. Kica omake ikome, oringo ogwako ngute, ci onoto leme.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" /><char style="wj">Wode owace ni, ‘Aba, dong abalo inyim Lubanga ki inyimi, pe dong amyero me alwonga ni an a wodi.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" /><char style="wj">Ento wone owaco bot lutice ni, ‘Wukel jor maber makato ducu wuruk ikome oyot; wurwak agit i nyig cinge, ki war i tyene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" /><char style="wj">Wukel bene wod twon mucwe, wuneki, wek wacamu, wabed ki yomcwiny.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" /><char style="wj">Pien latinani yam onongo oto woko, ento kombedi dong tye makwo; yam onongo orwenyo woko, ento dong kinonge.’ Ci gucako kwero karamane ki yomcwiny.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />
    <char style="wj">Wode madit onongo tye i poto; ka dwogo ma dong onyiko cok ki ot, ci en owinyo wer ki myel.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" /><char style="wj">Ci en olwongo ngat acel ikin lutic, ka openye ni, ‘Man kono gin ango matye ka timeni?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" /><char style="wj">Laticu odoke iye ni, ‘Omeru dong odwogo, ci woru oneke wod twon mucwe, pien ojole ma kome yot kun kwo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" /><char style="wj">Ento kiniga omake, okwero donyo i ot. Wone okati woko obako doge bote.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" /><char style="wj">Ento en odoke iye ni, ‘Nen, pi mwaka magi mapol ata an atiyo boti, ma naka yam peya akwero winyo ciki, ento peya imiya kadi wa latin dyel mamwa, wek cwinya obed yom ki lurema.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" /><char style="wj">Ento latini man obino ma olanyo limi ducu ikom mon ma lukwele, ci in ineke wod twon mucwe!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" /><char style="wj">Wone ogamo doge ni, ‘Latina, in nino ducu itye kweda do, jamina ducu ma atye kwede obedo meri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" /><char style="wj">Ber wacam kun wabedo ki yomcwiny, pien omeruni yam onongo oto woko, ento kombedi en dong kwo, yam onongo orwenyo woko, ento dong ginonge.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom lagwok jami ma pe ki ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye ngat mo ma lalonyo, matye ki lagwok jamine. Kidoto danonu bote ni tye ka lanyo jamine.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" /><char style="wj">Ci en olwonge, ka openye ni, ‘Lok ango mono ma awinyo i komini? Kela wel jamina ducu ma igwokoni kikore, pien pe dong i bibedo lagwok jamina.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" /><char style="wj">Lagwok jamine oloko kekene ni, ‘Abitimo gin ango? Pien rwoda dong obikwanya woko ki i tic me gwoko jami. An pe atek ma aromo pur, lewic bene maka kalego lim alega.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" /><char style="wj">Dong angeyo gin ma abitimo, ka giryema woko ki i tic me gwoko jami, wek dano gujola i odigi.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" /><char style="wj">Ci olwongo lubanya pa ladite ki acel acel, openyo dano mukwongo ni, ‘Wel banya adi pa rwoda matye boti?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" /><char style="wj">En odoke iye ni, ‘Moo jeituni maromo jereken miya acel.’ Ci lagwok jami owace ni, ‘Kwany waraga banyani, ibed piny oyotoyot, ci ico pyere abic.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" /><char style="wj">Lacen openyo ngat mukene ni, ‘In kono itye ki wel banya adi?’ En ogamo ni, ‘Ngano maromo guniya miya acel.’ Ci owace ni, ‘Kwany waraga banyani, ico pyere aboro.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" /><char style="wj">Pieno ladit man opwoyo lagwok jami ma pe ki ada, pien otiyo ki ryeko. Pien dano me lobo man giryek i yalwakgi, gitye ki diro me tic makato dano me dero.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ci Yecu omede kiwaconi, <char style="wj">“Atito botwu ni, wumak lurem kun wutiyo ki lim ma pe atir, wek ka bitum, kijolwu ikabedo ma bedo matwal.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />
    <char style="wj">Ngat ma lagen ikom jami matidi mo, bibedo ma lagen bene ikom jami madwong; ngat ma pe lagen ikom jami matidi mo, pe bibedo lagene bene ikom jami madwong.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" /><char style="wj">Dong ka yam pe wubedo ma lugen ikom lim me lobo man ma pe atir, ci dong anga ma bimiyowu lonyo me ada?</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" /><char style="wj">Dong ka yam pe wubedo jo ma lugen ikom jami pa dano mukene, anga ma bimiyowu jamiwu kikome?</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pe tye latic mo matwero tiyo tic ki rwodi aryo lawangacel; pien ka otime ci en bikwero ngat acel woko, ci bimaro ngat mukene, nyo biketo cwinye me tic pi ngat acel, ci bicayo ngat mukene. Pe itwero tic pi Lubanga ka dok itiyo pi lim bene.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok abola mogo ma Yecu owaco</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mar 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Luparicayo mayam lumar lim guwinyo lok man ducu, ci gucaye. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ento Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun aye jo ma wunyute bot dano ni kitwu atir, ento Lubanga ngeyo cwinywu; pien gin ma dano dworo ni pire tek, en aye gin ma konye peke inyim Lubanga.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Cik pa Moses ki coc pa lunebi obedo tye nio wa ikare pa Jon. Cake ikare meno kitito lok me Kwena Maber ma mako ker pa Lubanga, ci dano ducu gidonyo iye ki tek.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat 5:18</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento twero bedo yot mada me wek polo ki lobo gurweny woko, makato ton acel me cik me rwenyo woko.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yecu opwonyo ikom keto nyom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Laco mo keken ma oryemo dakone, ce dok onyomo dako mukene nongo otimo abor, ki ngat ma onyomo dako ma cware oryemo bene nongo otimo abor.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laco ma lalonyo ki Lajaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />
    <char style="wj">Yam tye dano mo ma lalonyo ma ruku bongo ma lamar lamar ki kanyi maber me bongo camanini kun kwo dok camo bene cam me wel madwong nino ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" /><char style="wj">I dog gange onongo lacan mo butu iye, nyinge Lajaro, ma kome orwato bur,</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" /><char style="wj">kun cwinye gomo me camo cam ma oo piny ki iwi meja pa lalonyonu; gwogi bene onongo gibino ginango wang bure.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" /><char style="wj">Ka lacan oto, ci lumalaika gutinge, gutere i kor Abraim. Lalonyo bene oto, ci giyike woko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" /><char style="wj">Oilo wange ki i Kapiny kun tye ki can, ci oneno Abraim tye kamabor kun Lajaro ojenge i kore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" /><char style="wj">Ci en odange ni, ‘Wora Abraim, tima kica, cwal Lajaro olut lwet cinge i pii, wek okwe ki leba, pien atye ki arem madwong i mac man.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" /><char style="wj">Ento Abraim odoke iye ni, ‘Woda, po ni, ikare me kwoni gimiyi gin mabeco, ki Lajaro kitmeno kimiye gin maracu; ento kombedi dong gikweyo cwinye kany, in kono itye ki arem.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" /><char style="wj">Dok bene ikom lok man ducu, ikin wan ki wun kiketo iye longo matut, wek ka jo ma gimito ngolo nia ki kany, me bino botwu, pe otwere, wek ngat mo bene pe ongol nia ki kunu me bino botwa kany.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" /><char style="wj">Lalonyo owaco ni, ‘Dong alegi ba, wora, ore i ot pa abana,</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" /><char style="wj">pien atye ki omegina abic, wek en ocitit botgi, ci gin guwek bino ikabedo man me can.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" /><char style="wj">Ento Abraim odoke iye ni, ‘Omegini gitye ki Moses ki lunebi; wek guwiny lokgi.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" /><char style="wj">Lalonyo owaco ni, ‘Pe, wora Abraim; ento ka ngat mo ikin jo ma oto ocito botgi, ci gibingut.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" /><char style="wj">Ento Abraim dok owace ni, ‘Ka pe giwinyo lok pa Moses ki pa lunebi, ci kadi bed ngat mo oa ki ikin jo muto bene, pe gibiye loke.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Bal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Gin mamiyo dano poto i bal pe bigenge; ento ngat ma bikelo gin mamiyo dano poto i bal bineno can!</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" /><char style="wj">Kono onongo bedo ber bot dano meno ka kitweyo kidi rego ingute, ci kibole kwede i nam, kato ma en oweko ngat acel ikin lutino matino magi opoto ibal.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Wugwoke kenwu; ka lawoti obalo, juke, ka ongut, ci time kica.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">Mat 18:21-22</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ka otimo bal ikomi tyen abiro inino acel, ce oloke boti tyen abiro, kun legi ni, ‘Angut,’ time kica.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Niye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Lukwena guwaco bot Rwot ni, “Med niye wa!” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Rwot ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Kono yam wutye ki niye macalo nyig karadali, kono wuwaco ki yat man ni, ‘Pute keni, ipite i dye nam,’ kono owinyo dogwu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa latic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Anga ikinwu matye ki latice ma puru ki kweri dyang nyo kwayo romi, ma ka en odwogo ki i poto ci wace ni, ‘Bin oyotoyot ibed piny kacam’?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" /><char style="wj">Pe kong en biwace ni, ‘Yuba cam me otyeno, ci itwe bongo ipyeri ikela cam, nio ka an acamo, amato, lacen ka dong atyeko ci in bene ibicamo dok ibimato’?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" /><char style="wj">Latici mono bimito ni i pwoye ka ilubu lok ma kicike kwede?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" /><char style="wj">Pe gire. Wun bene kitmeno, ka wutyeko tiyo gin ducu ma kicikowu, myero wuwac ni, ‘Wan lutic ma mwa; watiyo gin ma myero keken.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango ludobo apar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ka onongo Yecu tye kacito Jerucalem, ci owok ki iwang apoki me Camaria ki Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ka odonyo i paco mo, ci ludobo guromo kwede, kun gucung ki kamabor, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ci gudange ni, “Yecu, Rwoda, kica omaki ikomwa do.” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lev 14:1-32</ref> </char></note> Yecu onenogi, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit wunyute kenwu bot ajwaki pa Lubanga”</char> Ma onongo pud gitye i yoo kacito, ci komgi olonye woko. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ngat acel ikin gi ka oneno ni ecang woko, ci odwogo cen kun pako Lubanga ki dwon malongo; <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />oryebe piny katyen Yecu, kun pwoye. En onongo Lacamaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yecu openyo ni, <char style="wj">“Yam pe kicango dano apar? Jo abongwen kono gitye kwene?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" /><char style="wj">Pingo pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma odwogo cen ka pako Lubanga, ento kono larok man keken?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“A, icit giri, niyeni ocangi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bino me ker pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:36-41">36-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Luparicayo gupenyo Yecu ni, “Ker pa Lubanga bibino awene?” En odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ker pa Lubanga pe bibino ki lanyut ma gineno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" /><char style="wj">Pe kibiwaco botwu ni, ‘Nen, en ene!’ nyo ni, ‘En ca!’ Pien nen, ker pa Lubanga dong tye ikinwu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Kare bibino ma wubiparo me neno nino acel mo pa Wod pa dano, ento pe wubineno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" /><char style="wj">Kibiwaco botwu ni, ‘Nen, en ene!’ nyo ni, ‘Nen, en ca!’ Pe wucit iye, bene pe wulubgi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" /><char style="wj">Pien kit macalo lutkot wil, ci menyo but lobo tungcel nio tungcel, Wod pa dano bene bibedo kitmeno i ninone.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" /><char style="wj">Ento myero kong okany can madwong, kun yalwak me kare man bene gikwere.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Aca 6:5-8</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Macalo yam otime ikare pa Nua, ci bene bitime kitmeno ikare pa Wod pa dano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Aca 7:6-24</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Yam onongo gubedo kun gicamo, gimato dok awobegi ki anyiragi ginyome, nio inino ma Nua odonyo kwede i yeya, ci pii aluka ocore otyekogi woko ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Aca 18:20—19:25</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Kitmeno bene ikare pa Lot, onongo gicamo, gimato, giwilo jami, gicato jami, kipito ginapita, gigero odi;</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" /><char style="wj">ento inino ma Lot oa woko ki i Codom mac ki kwir gweng calfa ma mac oliyo ocwer ki i polo, otyekogi woko ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" /><char style="wj">Bibedo bene kitmeno ikare ma kibinyutu iye Wod pa dano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mat 24:17</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mar 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ininonu, ngat matye iwi ot kun jamine tye iot, pe myero olor piny ka cokogi; kitmeno bene ngat matye i poto pe myero odwog paco.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Aca 19:26</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Wupo mono ikom dako pa Lot.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jon 12:25</ref> </char></note><char style="wj">Ngat ma mitoni item laro kwone pire kekene birwenyone, ento ngat ma ye rwenyo kwone pira, bigwoko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" /><char style="wj">Atitiwu ni, i dyewor meno jo aryo bibutu iwi kitanda acel, kibikwanyo ngat acel, ci kibiweko ngat mukene dong.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" /><char style="wj">Mon aryo gibibedo ka rego kacel; ci kibikwanyo ngat acel, kibiweko ngat mukene dong.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" /><char style="wj">[Co aryo bibedo i poto, kibikwanyo ngat acel, ci kibiweko ngat acel dong.”]</char><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Lupwonyene gupenye ni, “Kwene, Rwot?” En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kama kom dano ma oto tye iye, acut bene gicoke kunu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom dato ki langolkop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yecu obolo bot lupwonyene carolok man ma pwonyogi ni myero guleg jwijwi, guwek ol. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye langolkop i taun madit mo, ma pe lworo Lubanga kadi woro dano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" /><char style="wj">I taun madit meno bene yam onongo tye iye dato mo ma bino bote jwijwi kun wace ni, ‘Ngolkop ma atir ikom ngat ma pido kweda.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" /><char style="wj">Tyen mapol langolkop obedo kakwero; ento lacen oloko kekene ni, ‘Kadi bed pe alworo Lubanga, kadi woro dano,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" /><char style="wj">ento pien dato man yela, abingolo kop atir pire; gwok nyo en bijonya nono ki bino bota nino ducu.’” </char> <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ci Rwot owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwiny lok ma langolkop ma pe kite atir owaco.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" /><char style="wj">Pe itamoni Lubanga bingolo kop atir pi jo ma en oyero, ma gikok bote dyeceng ki dyewor? Itamoni en bigale ma pe timo gin mo pirgi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" /><char style="wj">Atito botwu ni, en bingolo kop atir oyotoyot. Ento Wod pa dano ka bibino, tika binongo niye i lobo?”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom Laparicayo ki lajog mucoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Dok obolo carolok bot jo ma gene ken gi, ni kitgi atir, kun gicayo jo mukene. Owaco ni, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" /><char style="wj">“Jo aryo yam gucito kalega i ot pa Lubanga, ngat acel Laparicayo, ngat mukene lajog mucoro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" /><char style="wj">Laparicayo ocung, olego gire kene kun waco ni, ‘Lubanga, apwoyi pien an pe acalo jo mukene, ma gin lubuma, jo ma pe gene, lutim abor, pe bene acalo lajog mucoro man.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" /><char style="wj">Arii kec kiryo i Cabit acel; amiyo dul me apar me jamina ducu ma alimo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" /><char style="wj">Ento lajog mucoro ocung kamabor, onongo pe mito wa ilo wange malo i polo, ento en odongo kore, kun waco ni, ‘Lubanga, tima kica, pien an labalo!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Atito botwu ni, dano man odok i ode ma opore inyim Lubanga makato ngat mukene ca; pien dano ducu ma kete kene ni edit, kibidwoke piny, ento ngat ma mwole kene kibimiye doko dit.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu omiyo gum ikom lutino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Dano gukelo bote lutino matino, wek oket cinge ikomgi; ka lupwonyene guneno, gujukugi. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ento Yecu olwongogi, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wuwek lutino gubin bota, pe wugeng gi; pien ker pa Lubanga tye pi jo macalo gin.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, ngat ma pe jolo ker pa Lubanga macalo latin matidi, pe bidonyo iye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laco ma lalonyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Laloc mo openyo Yecu ni, “Lapwony maber, atim gin ango wek anong kwo ma pe tum?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo ilwonga ni aber? Pe tye ngat mo maber kono Lubanga keken.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Nia 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nwo 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Nia 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Nwo 5:17</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Nia 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Nwo 5:19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:16">Nia 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Nwo 5:20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">e </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ingeyo Cik ni, ‘Pe i tim abor; pe ineki; pe ibed caden me goba; wor woru ki meni.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ogamo ni, “Alubu lok magi ducu cake wa ka tinona.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ka Yecu owinyo, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Pud tye gin acel mamite me atima; cat jami ducu ma itye kwede, ci mii lime ki lucan, ci i bibedo ki lwak lonyo ma kikano piri i polo; ka dong ibin icak lubu kora.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ento ka danonu owinyo lok man, ci okumu, pien onongo en dano ma olonyo tutwal. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ka Yecu obedo ka nene, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Tek mada bot lulonyo me donyo i ker pa Lubanga!</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" /><char style="wj">Pien bedo yot bot kinaga me donyo ki iwang libira, kato lalonyo me donyo i ker pa Lubanga”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Dano ducu ma guwinyo guwaco ni, “Ci anga matwero lare?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Ento Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Gin ma pe twere ki bot dano, ki bot Lubanga twere.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petero owaco ni, “Nen, wan waweko paciwa, walubi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />En owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Adada, awaco ki wun ni, pe tye ngat mo ma oweko ode, nyo dakone, nyo omegine, nyo lunyodone, nyo lutinone, pi ker pa Lubanga,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" /><char style="wj">ma pe bilimo cul makato meno tyen mapol ikare man, ki ikare ma bibino anyim en binongo kwo ma pe tum.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu dok onwoyo tito pi to ne tyen me adeke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yecu otero lupwonyene apar wiye aryo i mung, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wunen, waecito i Jerucalem, lok ducu ma lunebi gucoyo ikom Wod pa dano bicobbe kakare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" /><char style="wj">Pien kibimiye bot Lurok, ci kibingale, dok kibitimo aranyi ikome, kun kibingulu wa laa ikome.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" /><char style="wj">Gibipwode ki del anino, ci kibineke, ento inino me adeke en bicer.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ento lupwonyene pe guniang lok ma en owaco; pien kikano telok man woko ki botgi, ci pe gumedo ki ngeyo lok ma kiwaco botgi.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocango latowang cok ki Jeriko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Ka dong gunyiko cok ki Jeriko, latowang mo onongo obedo piny inget yo kun lego lim. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ka en owinyo lwak tye ka mol ma gin kato ki ka ngete, ci openyo ni, “Meno kono gin ango?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Kitite ni, “Yecu me Najaret aye tye kakato.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Latowang odange ni, “Yecu Lakwar Daudi, kica omaki ikoma ba!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Dano ma onongo gutelo nyim Yecu gujuke ni, “Ling, nye;” ento en omede ameda ki dange ni, “Lakwar Daudi, kica omaki ikoma ba!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Ka Yecu ocung, ci owaco ni kikele bote. Ka obino cok, ci Yecu openye ni, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" /><char style="wj">“Imito atimi gin ango?”</char> Ci latowang ogamo ni, “Rwot, amito ni wanga onen piny odoco.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ci Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Nen giri piny, niyeni ocangi.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Cutcut wange ocako neno piny, ci olubu kor Yecu kun miyo deyo bot Lubanga. Dano ducu ka guneno, ci gupako Lubanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ki Jakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yecu odonyo i Jeriko kun onongo obikato akata. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Onongo tye kunu dano mo ma nyinge Jakayo, lajog mucoro madit, dok lalonyo bene. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />En onongo tye kayenyo yo me neno Yecu, ento pe otwero pi lwak, pien en onongo cek. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Pieno en oringo anyim, oito iwi yat olam wek enene, pien Yecu onongo obiwok ki i yoonu. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ka Yecu oo ikabedonu, oneno malo, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Jakayo, lor piny oyotoyot; pien tin myero abed i odi.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Jakayo olor oyotoyot, ci ojole ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ka dano ducu guneno, ci gungur kun giwaco ni, “Nen laco man odonyo i ot kabedo welo pa dano ma labalo.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Jakayo oa malo, owaco bot Rwot ni, “Nen, Ladit, abimiyo nucu jamina bot lucan; ka abumo ngat mo i gin mo, abicule wang angwen.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Tin lar obino i ot man, pien en bene lakwar Abraim.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mat 18:11</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien Wod pa dano obino kayenyo ki ka laro jo ma orwenyo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom nyig Jabu apar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka pud dano gitye kawinyo lok man, Yecu omede ki loke, kun bolo botgi carolok, pien onongo dong cok ki Jerucalem, dok pien onongo gitamo ni ker pa Lubanga binen cutcut. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Pimeno en owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye wod ker mo ma oa ocito i lobo mabor ka limo twerone me loc ka dong odwog cen.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" /><char style="wj">Ci en olwongo lutice apar, ci opoko botgi nyig jabu acel acel, kun owaco botgi ni, ‘Wucat ki wil nio wang ma an adwogo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" /><char style="wj">Ento dano me lobone gukwere, gucwalo lukwena i kore ki lok ni, ‘Pe wamito dano man olowa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" /><char style="wj">Ikare madong en odwogo, madong ocamo ker, ci ociko ni kilwong lutic mayam emiyogi lim mi, wek enge wel magoba ma gulimo i cato wilgi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" /><char style="wj">Dano mukwongo obino inyime, ci owaco ni, ‘Ladit, nyig jabu acel ma imiyani wiye omede ki apar mukene.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" /><char style="wj">Ci ladite ogamo ni, ‘Ber, in latic maber! Pien yam ibedo lagen ikom jami matidi mo, i bibedo ki twero ikom taun madongo apar.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" /><char style="wj">Dano me aryone obino, owaco ni, ‘Ladit, lim ma imiya ni wiye dok omede ki abic mukene.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" /><char style="wj">Ci en owace ni, ‘In bene i bibedo ki twero ikom taun madongo abic.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" /><char style="wj">Latic mukene dok obino, owaco mere ni, ‘Ladit, limi en, agwoko, aboyo woko liking ikitambara,</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" /><char style="wj">pien onongo alwori, pien in idano magwar; ikwanyo gin ma pe ikano, ikayo kac bene kama pe icoyo iye kodi.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" /><char style="wj">Laditi owace ni, ‘Abingolo kop loyi kun lubu lok ma oa ki idogi keni, in latic marac! Yam ingeyo ni an a dano magwar, akwanyo gin ma pe akano, akayo kac bene kama pe acoyo iye kodi,</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" /><char style="wj">pingo dong pe ikano lima i benge, wek ka adwogo, agam lima ki magoba mo?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" /><char style="wj">Ci owaco bot jo ma gucung ka ngete ni, ‘Wugam nyig jabu aceli woko ki bote wumii bot ngat matye ki nyig jabu aparni.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />[<char style="wj">Ento gin guwace ni, ‘Ladit, en dong tye ki nyig jabu apar!’</char>] <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ci en owaco ni, ‘Atito botwu ni, dano ducu matye ki gin mo aye kibimedo bote gin mo; ento ngat ma pe ki gin mo, kibikwanyo woko ki bote kadi wa gin manok matye bote.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" /><char style="wj">Ento lukwora magi, ma gin gukwera ni pe abed lalocgini, wukelgi kany, wunekgi ki pala lucwan inyima.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu odonyo i Jerucalem ki deyo madwong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ikare ma Yecu otyeko loko lok man, ci owoto anyim kun cito malo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ka dong onyiko cok ki Betepage ki Betania, ite got ma kilwongo ni Jeituni, Yecu ocako oro jo aryo ki ikin lupwonyene, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />kun cikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit i gang matye inyimwu. Kace wudonyo iye wubinongo latin kana ma kitweyo, ma ngat mo peya oito iwiye; ci wugony, wukel kany.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" /><char style="wj">Ka ngat mo openyowu ni, ‘Wugonye pingo?’ Wun wubidok iye kit man ni, ‘Rwot aye mito.’”</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Kitmeno jo ma kiorogi gucito, ci gunongo kit macalo Yecu otito botgini. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ka gitye ka gonyo latin kana, wegine gupenyogi ni, “Wugonyo latin kana pingo?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Gudok iye botgi ni, “Rwot aye mito.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ci gukelo latin kana bot Yecu. Gupeto ginarukagi iwiye, ci guweko Yecu oito iwiye. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ka dong kana tye kawot kwede, dano gubedo ka peto ginarukagi i wangayo. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ikare madong gunyiko cok ki Jerucalem, i lung me got Jeituni, lwak lupwonyene ducu cwinygi obedo yom, ci gupako Lubanga ki dwon malongo pi tic madito ma guneno, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Jab 118:26</ref> </char></note> kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Tye ki gum rwot ma bino inying Rwot Lubanga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Kuc obed iwi polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">ki deyo obed bot Lubanga ikabedo mamalo twal!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Luparicayo mogo ma onongo gitye ikin lwak guwaco bot Yecu ni, “Lapwony, juk lupwonyeni.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Atito botwu ni, ka kono joni guling, ci godi magi kikomgi kono aye gudange.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu okumu pi Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ka dong Yecu onyiko cok, en oneno taun madit man, ci okok pire, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Tini ka kono onongo ingeyo lok makelo kuc boti, kono ber! Ento koni dong kikano woko ki boti.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" /><char style="wj">Pien kare bibino ikomi ma lukwori gibitoro lobo rumi woko dyere, ci gibingolowi tungi ki tungi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" /><char style="wj">Kibireti piny, in ki lutinoni; pe kibiweko gweng mo acel i ii dong ma odode iwi wadi; pien yam pe ingeyo kare ma kibilimi iye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocito odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ka Yecu odonyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci en ocako ryemo lucat wil woko ki iye, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Ica 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref> </char></note> kun waco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kicoyo ni, ‘Oda bibedo ot me lega,’ ento wun wuloko odoko boro pa luyak.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk 21:37</ref> </char>
    </note> Yecu obedo ka pwony i Ot pa Lubanga nino ducu. Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik ki jo madito ikin lwak guyenyo yo me neke; <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ento pe gunongo gin mo ma myero gutim ikome, pien dano ducu guketo cwinygi kawinyo loke.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kipenyo kit twer pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Inino mo acel ka Yecu tye ka pwonyo dano i Ot pa Lubanga kun tito lok me Kwena Maber, ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik ki ludongo gubino, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />ci gupenye ni, “Tit botwa, twero ango ma omiyo itimo gin magi; nyo anga ma omiini twero man?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yecu odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“An bene abipenyowu ki peny acel; wek wudoka iye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" /><char style="wj">Batija pa Jon twerone oa ki i polo nyo ki bot dano?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Guporo loke keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Ka wawaco ni, ‘Oa ki i polo,’ ci en bipenyowa ni, ‘Pingo pe wuye en?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ento ka wawaco ni, ‘Oa ki bot dano,’ ci danonu ducu gibicelowa ki gweng; pien dano ducu giye atika ni Jon aye lanebi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ma omiyo gudok iye bot Yecu ni pe gingeyo kama oa iye. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“An bene pe abitito botwu kit twer ma omiyo atiyo tic magi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom poto olok ki lupur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Ica 5:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Yecu ocako bolo carolok man bot lwak ni, <char style="wj">“Yam tye dano mo ma opito olok i potone, ci oweko bot jo ma puru, ci en ocito woko wa i lobo mukene, orii kunu pi kare malac.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" /><char style="wj">Ka kare oromo, ci en ooro latice bot lupur poto ni myero gumine nyig olok mogo; ento lupur poto gugoye, guryeme ci odok ki cinge nono.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" /><char style="wj">En dok ooro latic mukene; gin gugoyo en bene, gutimo tim aranyi ikome, ci guryeme kwede odok ki cinge nono.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" /><char style="wj">Dok ooro me adeke; guketo ret ikom man, ci gucwale woko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" /><char style="wj">Lacen won poto olok owaco ni, ‘Abitimo gin ango dong? Abioro woda ma amaro; gwok nyo gibiwore.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" /><char style="wj">Ento ikare ma lupur gunene, guloko keken gi ni, ‘Man aye dong lale lim kikome; waneke woko, wek lim ma en bileyoni obed mewa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" /><char style="wj">Ci gucwale woko ki i poto olok, ka guneke. Won poto dong bitimogi ningning?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" /><char style="wj">En bibino, ci neko lupur poto meno woko ducu, ci bimiyo poto olok bot jo mukene.” Ka guwinyo lok man, guwaco ni, “Pe myero otime kumeno!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Jab 118:22</ref> </char></note> Ento Yecu ociko wange ikomgi, ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Man kono teloke ngo, mayam kicoyo i ginacoya ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">‘Got ma lugedo gukweroni</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">en aye odoko got madit ma pire tek’?</char><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />
    <char style="wj">Dano ducu ma poto ikom got man bitur woko; ento ka got man opoto ikom ngat mo, ci binyote woko.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Lupwonycik ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga gumito make icawanu, ento gulworo lwak; pien guniang ni en obolo carolok man ikomgi.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Culu mucoro bot cecar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Gin gungiyo te kare maber, wek kioro lurot piny, ma giporo bedo ni gin jo ma gene, wek gumak lok ma a idoge, wek gumiye ite loc ki twero pa luloc ki luket cik. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Gin gupenye ni, “Lapwony, wangeyo ni in iloko dok ipwonyo lok matye atir, pe ipoko kin dano, ento ipwonyo yo pa Lubanga ki ada.” <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Titi wa, “Myero wacul mucoro bot Cecar nyo pe?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ento Yecu oniang ryekogi, ci openyogi ni, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" /><char style="wj">“Kong wunyuta lim ma kiculu kwede. Cal ki coc matye ikomeni pa anga?”</char> Gugamo ni, “Pa Cecar.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wudwok jami pa Cecar bot Cecar, ki jami pa Lubanga wudwok bot Lubanga.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Pe gutwero mako lok mo ma oa ki idoge inyim lwak; ento guuru kit ma en ogamo kwede lok, ci guling alinga.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom cer ki ikin jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Tic 23:8</ref> </char>
    </note> Lucadukayo mogo gubino bot Yecu, gin aye jo ma onongo giwaco ni jo ma oto pe gicer. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Nwo 25:5</ref> </char></note> Gupenye ni, “Lapwony, Moses yam ocoyo botwa ni, ka laco mo oto woko ma oweko dakone ma pe ki lutino, ci omine myero olak dakonu, wek onywal kwede lutino ka wi omine. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Yam onongo tye omego abiro; ngat mukwongo onyomo dako, ci oto labongo lutino. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Me aryone olako dakonu, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />me adeke bene gulako dakonu, kitmeno gin abiro ducu gubedo ki dakonu, ci guto labongo lutino. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Lacen dakonu bene oto. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ikare me cer ki ikin jo ma oto, dakonu bibedo dako pa anga ikin gi? Pien gin co abironi ducu gubedo kwede.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Jo me kare man ginyome;</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" /><char style="wj">ento jo ma kikwanogi ni myero guo i lobo maca, ki i cer ki ikin jo ma oto, pe ginyome, dok pe gibigero co.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" /><char style="wj">Pien pe dok gitwero to, dong girom ki lumalaika; gin lutino pa Lubanga, pien dong kicerogi woko ki i to.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Nia 3:6</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento ni jo muto twero cer, Moses kikome bene onyutu, i dul ma gikwano iye lok ikom caka ma pe owang ki mac kun mac lyel iwiye, en kama olwongo iye Rwot ni, ‘Lubanga pa Abraim, Lubanga pa Icaka, ki Lubanga pa Yakobo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" /><char style="wj">Dong Lubanga pe Lubanga pa jo muto, ento Lubanga pa jo makwo; pien dano ducu bedo kwo pire.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Jo mogo ikin Lupwonycik gugamo doge ni, “Lapwony, iwaco kakare.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Pimeno pe dok guete me penye ki lok mo.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peny ikom Kricito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ento Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Giwaco ningning ni Kricito ma Lubanga oyero en lakwar Daudi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien Daudi kikome bene owaco i buk me Jabuli ni</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Rwot owaco bot Rwoda ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">bed itung bada ma lacuc,</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />
    <char style="wj">nio ka abimiyo lukwori doko kom laten tyeni.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />
    <char style="wj">Kitmeno kace Daudi yam olwonge ni Rwot, ci dok en bedo lakware ningning?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ciko dano me gwoke ki Lupwonycik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luk 11:37-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ikare ma lwak ducu tye kawinyo loke, Yecu owaco bot lupwonyene ni, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" /><char style="wj">“Wugwoke ikom Lupwonycik ma gimaro wot ma guruku bongi maboco, dok gimito ni dano gubed ka motogi wa i cukgu, gimaro bedo iwi kom pa ludito, ka gitye ikacoke, dok gimaro bedo i kabedo me deyo i karama.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" /><char style="wj">Gin gimayo odi pa mon to, dok gibedo kalego lega maboco me buta keken. Kibingolo kop madit iwigi makato.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Mot ma dato omiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yecu oilo wange malo, ci oneno lulonyo ka gibolo motgi i canduk lim i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ci oneno dato mo ma lacan, ka obolo cente mola ma nyige aryo. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Adada awaco botwu ni, dato man ma lacan ni obolo lim madwong makato dano ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" /><char style="wj">Pien jo mukeneni ducu gugito but limgi madwongi aye gubolo, ento dato man i caneni, obolo lim ducu matye bote, ma konyo kwone.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi muku Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Jo mogo ikin lupwonyene gubedo kalok pi Ot pa Lubanga, kit ma kideyo kwede ki godi mabeco ki gityer ma kimiyo bot Lubanga, ci Yecu owaco ni, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" /><char style="wj">“Gin magi ducu ma wunenoni, kare bibino, ma pe kibiweko got acel mo ma odode iwi wadi ma pe kibicoro woko piny.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto i lobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Lupwonyene gupenyo Yecu ni, “Lapwony, man bitime awene, dok kit gin ango ma binyutu ka man dong cok time?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wugoke, dok pe ngat mo orwenywu; pien jo mapol gibibino inyinga, ma giwaco ni, ‘An aye a Kricito!’ dok ni, ‘Kare dong onyiko cok!’ Pe wulubgi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" /><char style="wj">Dok ka wubiwinyo pi lweny ki pi arubaruba, pe wubed ki lworo, pien meno kong myero otime, ento agik pe bibino oyotoyot.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Lacen owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Rok bilweny ki rok wadi, ker bene bilweny ki ker wadi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" /><char style="wj">Oyengyeng madongo biyengo lobo, kec laparanat ki two gemo mapatpat bipoto ikabedo mapol; ki gin mamiyo lworo mako dano, ki lanyut madongo bene, bia ki i polo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" /><char style="wj">Ento ma peya gin meno ducu otime, kong kibimakowu, kibilibowu, kibiterowu inyim kacoke kapido ikomwu, kibitweyowu ibuc, kibikelowu inyim luker ki inyim luloc pi nyinga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" /><char style="wj">Man aye bibedo kare botwu me tito lok me caden ikoma.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pimeno, wumok itamwu ni pe wubitamo con kit ma wubipido kwede,</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" /><char style="wj">pien abimiyowu twero me dok ilok ki ryeko, ma ngat mo ikin lukworwu pe bitwero ete ikomwu, kadi pyem kwedwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" /><char style="wj">Kadi wa lunyodowu ki omegiwu ki wadiwu ki luremwu bene gibidobowu, ci jo mogo ikinwu kibinekogi;</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" /><char style="wj">dano ducu bimon kwedwu pira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" /><char style="wj">Ento yer wiwu acel mo pe birwenyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" /><char style="wj">Ka wudiyo cwinywu, ci wubilaro kwowu.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito pi keto Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />
    <char style="wj">Ento ka wuneno mony orumu Jerucalem, ci wunge ni kare me keto tere dong onyiko cok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" /><char style="wj">Ci jo matye i Judaya myero guring iwi godi, jo matye i taun madit myero guring woko ki iye, jo matye woko ikin paco pe dok gudony i Jerucalem.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Koc 9:7</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien kare meno bibedo kare me culu kwor, ki bicobo lok ducu mayam kicoyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" /><char style="wj">Dok mon ma giyac gibineno can ikare meno, ki mon ma gidoto lutino bene! Pien can man ma madit bipoto i lobo, ki kiniga madwong bipoto ikom jo me rok man.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" /><char style="wj">Kibinekogi ki pala lucwan, kibiterogi me bedo opii ikin rok ducu; lurok gibinyono Jerucalem piny, nio ka kare pa lurok otum.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit ma Wod pa dano bidwogo kwede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Joe 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Niy 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">Lanyut binen ikom ceng, ikom dwe ki ikom lakalatwe, ci rok mapol ma iwi lobo bikumu kun nongo cwinygi bingabe angaba pi mor me biamwonyi ma i nam ma pii ne bitwage ma lik.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" /><char style="wj">Kom dano bimyel ki lworo, ka gibitamo gin ma bipoto ikom lobo; pien twer ma i polo ducu biyenge.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Lacen gibineno Wod pa dano kun bino iwi pol ki tek ki deyo madit.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" /><char style="wj">Ka gin magi dong ocako time, myero wua malo, myero wuil wiwu malo, pien kare me kokowu dong onyiko cok.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony ikom yat oduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yecu dok obolo carolok botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kong wunen yat oduru, ki yadi mukene ducu;</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" /><char style="wj">ka dong olot, wuneno pirwu kenwu, ci wungeyo ni oro dong cok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno wun bene, ka wuneno gin magi otime, myero wunge ni ker pa Lubanga dong onyiko cok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" /><char style="wj">Adada awaco botwu ni, yalwak me kare man pe bitum nio wang ma lok magi ducu otime.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" /><char style="wj">Polo ki lobo bitum, ento loka pe bitum.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wubed ma wukiyo piny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />
    <char style="wj">Ento wugwoke kenwu, cwinywu owek doko nwang pi woro me cam, ki mero kongo, ki pi paro lok me kwo man ma miyo wubedo ki tam mapol, wek ninonu pe obin oumwu atura macalo akum.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" /><char style="wj">Pien bibino ikom jo ducu ma bedo iwi lobo ducu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" /><char style="wj">Ento wubed ma wangwu twolo kun wukiyo piny ikare ducu, kun wulego ni myero wubed ki tek me bwot ki i lok magi ducu ma bitime, ki me cung inyim Wod pa dano.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nino ducu onongo Yecu pwonyo i Ot pa Lubanga dyeceng, ento dyewor woto butu iwi got ma kilwongo ni got Jeituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Odiko con dano ducu nongo gibino bote i Ot pa Lubanga kawinyo loke.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Piro lok ikom Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Nia 12:1-27</ref> </char>
    </note> Nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe Iye ma kilwongo Karama me Kato onongo onyiko cok. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki lupwonycik gubedo kayenyo kit yo ma myero ginek kwede Yecu; pien onongo gilworo lwak.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juda oye me dobo Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ci Catan odonyo i cwiny Juda Lakeriot ma en onongo dano acel ikin lupwonye apar wiye aryoni. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ci Juda Lakeriot ocito oporo lok ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludito acikari me Ot pa Lubanga, kit yo ma myero emii Yecu kwede botgi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Cwinygi obedo yom, ci gucako cike me miye lim. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Juda oye, ci omiyo oyenyo kare maber ma myero emii Yecu kwede botgi ma nongo lwak peke.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu oyube me camo Karama me Kato kacel ki lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ci dong nino me Mugati ma Tobi Pe Iye oromo, ma kitumu iye latin romo me Karama me Kato. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ci Yecu ooro Petero ki Jon, kun cikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wucit wuyub cam me Karama me Kato pirwa, wek wacam.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ci gupenye ni, “Imito ni waciyub kwene?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Nen, ka wudonyo i taun madit me Jerucalem, ci laco mo birwate kwedwu kun oyeyo agulu pii; en aye wulub kore wa i ot ma en bidonyo iye,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" /><char style="wj">ci wutit bot won ot ni, ‘Lapwony penyi ni, ot welo tye kwene, kama abicamo iye cam me Karama me Kato kacel ki lupwonyena?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" /><char style="wj">Ci en binyutu botwu kicika ot malac ma malone ma kipeto, kiyubu maber; wek wuyub ki wan kabedo kunu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ci gucito gunongo kit macalo Yecu owaco botgini, ci guyubu cam me Karama me Kato kunu.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cam me otyeno pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ka cawa oromo, Yecu obedo piny i dog cam, kacel ki lukwena.<verse eid="LUK 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acaki lok ikom Cam pa Rwotwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1 Kor 11:23-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Abedo ka mito mada me camo cam me Kato man kwedwu, ma kun nongo pud peya aneno can.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" /><char style="wj">Pien awaco botwu ni, pe dok abicamo nio ka te loke ocobe kakare i ker pa Lubanga”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ci otingo kikopo, kadong otyeko miyo pwoc ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Wumak man, wupok ikinwu;</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" /><char style="wj">pien awaco botwu ni, nia kombedi pe dok abimato pig olok nio wang ma ker pa Lubanga obino.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ci omako mugati, kadong otyeko miyo pwoc, ci obaro iye, omiyogi kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Man aye koma ma kimiyo pirwu, wutim kuman me po pira.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref> </char></note> Kitmeno kadong gucamo otum otingo kikopo, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Kikopo man aye gicike manyen i remona ma oo pirwu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Jab 41:9</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento, nen, ngat ma bidoba cinge tye kacel kweda i dog cam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><char style="wj">Wod pa dano bicito gire kit macalo yam kiciko; ento bedo rac marom mene pi dano meno ma dobo Wod pa dano pien bineno can!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Lupwonyene gucako penye keken gi ni, anga ki ikin gi ma bitimo lok man.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyem pi laro dito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9:46</ref> </char>
    </note> Pyem bene ocake ikin lupwonyene ni anga ikin gi ma kitamo ni loyo ki dit. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mar 10:42-44</ref> </char></note> Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Luker pa lurok giloyo lwakgi ki tek, dok jo matye ki twero ikomgi kilwongogi ni lutim ber.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento pe kitmeno botwu; ngat madit ikinwu myero odok macalo ngat matidi, ki latela wic myero obed macalo ngat ma tiyo pi dano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><char style="wj">Pieno anga madit, ngat ma bedo i dog cam, kece mono ngat makele cam? Pe ngat ma bedo i dog cami, tye gire kumeno. Ento an abedo ikinwu macalo ngat ma tiyo pi dano.</char><verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />
    <char style="wj">Wun aye jo ma wubedo ka ngeta jwijwi ikare ducu ma kibedo ka tema.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" /><char style="wj">Macalo Wora omiya ker, an bene abimiyowu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><char style="wj">Wun wubicam, dok wubimato i dog mejana i kera, dok wubibedo iwi komker kun wungolo kop iwi kaka apar wiye aryo pa jo Icrael.</char><verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu otito ni Petero bikwere woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />
    <char style="wj">Cimon, Cimon, nen Catan otyeko penyo pirwu me apyeta macalo lapur pyeto ngano poko woko ki ikom cunge, wek ipok ki ikinwu jo mabeco ki maracu,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" /><char style="wj">ento dong alego piri ni niyeni pe odok cen. In bene ka dong iloke idwogo cen, myero ijing cwiny utmegini.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petero owace ni, “Rwot, dong atyeko yube me cito kwedi wa i buc ki to.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yecu odoke iye ni, <char style="wj">“Petero, awaci ni, tin twong gweno pe bikok, nio wang ma ikwera tyen adek ni pe ingeya.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicaa lim, opiru, ki pala lucwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mat 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mar 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Yecu openyo lupwonyene ni, <char style="wj">“Ikare mayam aorowu labongo kicaa lim, nyo opiru, kadi war, ci gin mo oremowu?”</char> Gin gugamo ni, “Pe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ci ocikogi ni, <char style="wj">“Ento kombedi dong, ngat matye ki kicaa lim, myero oter, ki opiru bene kitmeno. Ngat ma pe ki pala lucwan myero ocat kanyine, wek owil kwede.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Ica 53:12</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Pien awaco botwu ni, ginacoya man myero ocobe kakare ikoma ni, ‘Kikwane kacel ki lubalo’; pien lok ma kicoyo ikoma tye ka cobe kakare.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Lupwonyene guwace ni, “Rwot, nen, pala lucwan tye kany aryo.” En odok iye botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Meno romo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu olego i poto Gececemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yecu okato woko, ci ocito iwi got Jeituni kit ma onongo en timo kare ki kare; ci lupwonyene gulubu kore. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ka oo i kabedo meno, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wuleg Lubanga, wek pe wudony i abita mo.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ci oa opoke kwedgi marom ki kama ka kibayo iye lakidi, ci orumu conge piny, olego ni, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" /><char style="wj">“Wora, ka i mito, kwany kikopo man woko ki bota, ento pe obed kit macalo an amito; ento wek nimito ni aye ocobe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ci lamalaika ma oa ki i polo onen bote kun jingo cwinye. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ka kun onongo en tye ki kumu ki ton cwiny malit mada, ci en omede ki lega matek; omiyo kwok ocore ikome macalo remo ma cwer ton i ngom. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ka oa ki kalega, en obino bot lupwonye, ci onongo gunino woko pi aremcwiny. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ci en owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wunino pingo? Wua malo, wuleg Lubanga, wek pe wudony i abita mo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimako Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jon 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ka onongo Yecu pud tye kalok, ci lwak gubino, kun dano ma nyinge Juda aye otelo wigi, en ngat acel ikin lupwonyene apar wiye aryoni. Onyiko cok bot Yecu wek emote kun enoto leme. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ento Yecu openye ni, <char style="wj">“Juda, in idobo Wod pa dano ki noto lem?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ka jo ma ingete guneno gin mamito time, ci gupenyo ni, “Rwot, watong dano ki pala lucwan?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ci ngat acel ki ikin gi otongo opii pa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, onguno ite ma lacuc woko. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ento Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Ogik dong ki man keken!”</char> Obongo ite, ci ocange. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Lacen Yecu owaco bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludito pa acikari me Ot pa Lubanga, ki ludongo ma gubino ikome, ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo wubino ikoma ki pala lucwan ki odo gu me maka macalo wubino ikom layak mo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Yam abedo kwedwu jwijwi i Ot pa Lubanga, ci pe wumaka. Ento kombedi dong aye karewu me tic ki twero me colpiny.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okwero Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jon 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ci gumako Yecu, gutere, gukele i ot pa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga. Ci Petero olubu kore kun woto ki cen ma ki borbor. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ka kimoko mac idyekal me wang oo, ma gubedo piny kacel, Petero bene obedo piny ikin gi. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ci angeca mo onene kun obedo kama mac ocaro; ongiye maber, ci owaco ni, “Dano man bene nakanen tye kacel kwede.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ento Petero okwero woko kun waco ni, “Dako, an pe angeye gira.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Lacen ka kare okato manok, ngat mukene dok onene, ci owaco ni, “In bene i ngat acel ikin gi.” Ento Petero owaco ni, “Nye, an ku!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ka kare dok okato mamito romo cawa acel, ngat mukene dok oloko kun moko ni, “Adadaeni, dano man nakanen tye kacel kwede; pien en Lagalilaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ento Petero ogamo ni, “Nye, an akwiya lok ma itye ka waconeni.” Cutcut ma pud en waco lok man, twong gweno otugi kok. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Rwot oloke oneno Petero. Ci Petero opo lok pa Rwot, kit macalo nakanen Yecu owace ni, <char style="wj">“Ma nongo twong gweno peya okok tin, ibikwera woko tyen adek kulu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Ci okato woko okok ki cwercwiny madwong.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinywaro Yecu, kigoye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Jo ma gumako Yecu gunyware, ci gugoye; <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />guboyo wange woko ki kitambara kun gipenye ni, “Ka in lanebi tuci! Anga mugoyi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Gin guloko lok mukene mapol ikome, kun giyete bene.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocung inyim kot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jon 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ka piny dong oru, ludongo pa lwak, kacel ki ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik, gucoke kacel; ci gukele inyim luotkot ka pidogi, ci guwaco ni, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Tit botwa kace in aye i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.” Ento Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Ka atito botwu, wun pe wubiye;</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" /><char style="wj">ka apenyowu wun pe wubidoka iye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" /><char style="wj">Ento nicake kombedi Wod pa dano bibedo piny ikabedo me deyo ka nget Lubanga Won Twer tung lacuc.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Gin ducu gugamo ni, “Dong in i Wod pa Lubanga do?” Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Wun wuwaco ni an a en.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ci guwaco ni, “Dok wamito caden me ngo? Wan dong wawinyo pirwa kenwa ki idoge kene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu inyim Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jon 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Lwak ducu gutware, ci gutero Yecu inyim Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Ci gudote kun giwaco ni, “Dano man wanongo tye ka rwenyo rokwa. En ogengowa ni pe wacul mucoro bot Cecar, kun lwonge kene ni en Kricito, Rwot.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Ci Pilato openye ni, “In i Rwot pa Lujudaya bo?” Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“In dong iwaco giri.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato owaco bot ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki lwak ducu ni, “Pe anongo kop marac ikom dano man.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ento gin gudiye kun giwaco ni, “Danonu poyo lwak, kun pwonyo i lobo Judaya ducu, cake ki i Galilaya nio kwede wa kany.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocung inyim Kerode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ka Pilato owinyo lok man ci openyo ka gwok nyo Yecu Lagalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ka oniang ni en tye ite loc pa Kerode, ci ocwale bot Kerode, ma en kikome bene onongo tye i Jerucalem i karenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ka Kerode oneno Yecu, ci cwinye obedo yom tutwal, pien onongo yam con omito mada me nene, pien en onongo obedo kawinyo pire awinya, dok onongo ogeno ni ebineno lanyut me tango mo ma en bitiyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Omiyo Kerode openyo Yecu ki peny mapolpol; ento Yecu pe omedo ki dok iye lok mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki Lupwonycik inget kun gidote ki tek. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Kerode ki acikarine gungalo Yecu, ci gunyware; ka guruke ki bongo me deyo, ci gudwoke kwede bot Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kerode ki Pilato gudoko lurem inino meno cut, pien yam con onongo gimon ikin gi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingolo kop me to iwi Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato olwongo ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki luloc ki lwak kacel, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ci owaco botgi ni, “Wun wukelo dano man bota ni en ngat ma rwenyo lwak, an apenye inyimwu, ci nen, pe anongo kop mo marac ikome ikom lok ducu ma wudote kwede; <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />kadi Kerode bene pe onongo kop mo ikome, pien Kerode odwoko en botwa. Nen dano man, pe otimo gin mo ma myero kineke pire; <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />pimeno abigoye, ci abigonye. [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Ikare me karama me kato Paska ducu, yam onongo mite ni myero Pilato ogony botgi ngat acel pirgi.]”<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ento lwak ducu gudange lawangacel ni, “Pe wamite, neke woko! Gony ki wan Baraba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraba kono yam obedo dano ma kitweye ibuc pi tugu lwak i Jerucalem ki pi nek. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato dok oloko botgi, kun mito gonyo Yecu; <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />ento lwak gumede ki dange ni “Gure woko ikom yatariya, gure woko ikom yatariya!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato owaco botgi tyen me adeke ni, “Pingo ka? Otimo kit gin ango marac? An gira pe anongo kop mo marac ikome ma myero kineke pire; pimeno abigoye, ci abigonye.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ento lwak guwoo ki dange kun gidiye ni myero kigure ikom yatariya. Dwongi oloyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Omiyo Pilato ongolo kop ni myero kitim Yecu kit macalo gimito. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Ogonyo dano mayam kitweyo ibuc pi tugu dano ki pi nek, ma lwak gubako dogi bote pire; ento en omiyo Yecu botgi wek gutime kit macalo gimito.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiguro Yecu ikom yatariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ka acikari gitye katere dong woko, ci gumako Cimon, dano mo me Cirene ma onongo donyo i taun madit kun oa ki ikin paco, ci gucibo yatariya pa Yecu ma onongo otingoni igwoke, wek oting, olub ki kor Yecu; <figure style="fig" alt="The soldiers grabed Simon to carry the cross" file="4302326.TIF" size="col" copy="Ann Vollton" ref="23:26">Acikari gumako Cimon ci gucibo yatariya igwoke</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Lwak dano madwong gulube, ikin gi obedo mon mapol ma onongo gikumu kun gikok pire. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yecu oloke botgi ci owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Anyira Jerucalem, pe wukok pira, ento wukok pirwu kenwu ki pi lutinowu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" /><char style="wj">Pien nen, kare bibino ma dano gibiwaco ni, ‘Tye ki gum lulur, ki ot nyodo ma pe nywal, ki tunu ma pe gidoto!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Koc 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Niy 6:16</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ikare meno dano bilok ki godi madongo kun gibiwaco ni, ‘Wupot ikomwa’; ki bot godi matino ni, ‘Umwa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" /><char style="wj">Pien ka kitimo man ma yat pud dyak, ci bibedo ningning ka yat dong otwo?”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Jo aryo mukene, ma lutim tim maracu, bene kiterogi ka kinekgi kacel kwede. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ka guo ikabedo ma kilwongo Cogo Wic, ci kigure ikom yatariya kunu, ki lutim maracu aryo, ngat acel tung lacuc, ngat acel tung lacam. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Jab 22:18</ref> </char></note> Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Aba, wayi tim kica botgi, pien pe gingeyo gin ma gitye katiyone.”</char> Ci gubolo kwir pi poko ginarukane. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Jab 22:7</ref> </char></note> Lwak gucung kun gineno; ento luloc gunyware kun giwaco ni, “Yam olaro jo mukene, kong olare kene ka en Kricito ma Lubanga oyero!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Acikari bene gunyware, gubino gumine kongo bwino mawac, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />kun giwaco ni, “Ka in i Rwot pa Lujudaya, lare keni!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />I coc ma kiketo ka wiye, kicoyo ni, “Man aye Rwot pa Lujudaya.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ngat acel ikin lutim maracu ma kiguro kacel kwede ocaye kun wace ni, “In pe i Kricito ma Lubanga oyero ce? Lare keni dok ilar wan bene!” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ento lawoteni ojuke kun waco ni, “In pe ilworo Lubanga? Kingolo kop ikomi marom kwede. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Wan giwa kingolo kop ikomwa kakare; pien watye ka limo cul ma myero pi timwa; ento dano man pe otimo gin mo marac wa ki acel.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ci owaco ni, “Yecu, po pira ka ibidonyo i keri.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yecu odok iye bote ni, <char style="wj">“Adada, awaco ki in ni, tin i bibedo kweda ikabedo me kuc.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ka cawa dong mito romo abicel, piny ocido macol i lobo kunu ducu nio wa icawa abongwen, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Nia 26:31-33</ref> </char></note> kun wang ceng oume woko; ci bongo kicika me Ot pa Lubanga obar, dyere opoke aryo. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Jab 31:5</ref> </char></note> Ci Yecu odange ki dwon matek, kun waco ni, <char style="wj">“Aba, amiyo cwinya i cingi!”</char> Ka owaco lok man, ci oto. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ka ladit maloyo acikari oneno gin ma otime, opako Lubanga kun waco ni, “Adada, dano man kara peke ki bal mo!” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Lwak ducu ma gucoke ka nene, ka guneno gin ma otime, gudok paco kun gidongo korgi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref> </char></note> Lureme ducu ki mon mayam gubino kwede nia i Galilaya, gucung ki cen kun gineno gin man.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiko kom Yecu i lyel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Ikarenu onongo tye laco mo ma nyinge Yucepu ma oa ki i taun mo pa Lujudaya ma kilwongo Arimataya. En onongo dano maber dok kite atir, dok onongo kuru ker pa Lubanga. Kadi bed en onongo ngat acel ikin jo ma bedo iot pido, ci yam pe ocwako tamgi kadi ki ticgi bene. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Dano man ocito bot Pilato, olego pi kom Yecu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ci okwanye ki ikom yatariya, ci oboye ki bongo matar maryeny nidangdang malenge, ka opyele ilyel ma kikwinyo igot, kama peya kipyelo iye kom ngat mo. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ninonu onongo nino me Yube, pien ceng Cabit onongo dong cok cake. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Mon mayam gubino kwede nia ki i Galilaya, guneno lyele, ki kit ma kipyelo kwede kome; <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Nia 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Nwo 5:14</ref> </char></note> ci gudok cen, guyubu angwece ki moo wir.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">I ceng Cabit, guywe kit macalo Cik tye.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ocer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jon 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Inino mukwongo me cabit, mon ma gupuk kwarpiny, gubino iwi lyel, kun gikelo angwecegi ma guyubu. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Gunongo ni kingilo got woko ki i dog lyel, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />ento ka gudonyo ilyel, ci pe gunongo kom Rwot Yecu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ka onongo pud gitye kauru lok man, ci nen, co aryo gucung ingetgi ma guruku jor maryeny lidangdang. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Komgi oryange, ci guryebe piny, co nu gupenyogi ni, “Pingo wuyenyo dano makwo ikin jo ma oto? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />[En pe tye kany, ento ocer woko.] Wupo lok mayam en owaco botwu ikare ma pud en tye i Galilaya,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />ni, Wod pa dano myero kimiye i cing lubalo, wek kigure ikom yatariya, ci bicer woko inino me adeke.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ci mon gupo loke, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />ka gua ki iwi lyel gudok, ci gutito lok man ducu bot lupwonye apar wiye acel ca, ki bot jo mukene ducu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ci Maliam Lamagdala, gin ki Joana, ka Maliam min Yakobo, ki mon mukene ma onongo gitye kwedgi gutito lok man bot lukwena. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ento lokgi obedo calo lok mingo ki bot lukwena, ci pe guye lokgi. [<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ento Petero oa, oringo ocito iwi lyel; ka ocung oneno lyel, oneno bongi matar maryeny lidangdang matye ken gi pat; odok paco kun uru gin ma otime.]<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wot me cito Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ininonu kikome lupwonyene aryo pa Yecu ki ikin gi onongo nene gicito i paco ma kilwongo ni Emau, ma bore mito romo mairo abiro me o i Jerucalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Gin onongo gitye kaboko lok keken gi ikom gin ma otime. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ka onongo giboko lok man kun bene gilaro loke kacel, ci Yecu kikome onyiko cok, owoto kwedgi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ento wanggi oume woko, oweko pe gumedo kingeyo ni meno Yecu. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wularo lok ango kekenwu kun wutye ka woti?”</char> Gutugi cung woko mot ma wanggi nen ki can. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ci ngat acel ikin gi ma nyinge Kelopa, odok iye bote ni, “In i welo keni i Jerucalem ce, ma pe ingeyo lok ma otime kunu ikare man?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Gin ango?”</char> Gin gudoke iye ni, “Lok ikom Yecu Lanajaret, mayam obedo lanebi matek i loke ki itice inyim Lubanga, ki inyim dano ducu, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />ki kit ma ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki lulocwa gudobe ci gingolkop ikome me neke, ci gugure ikom yatariya. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ento yam wageno ni en aye ngat ma bikoko Icrael. Eyo, medo ikom meno ducu, tin dong nino me adek nia ma lok man otime. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Mon mogo ikinwa bene gumiyowa ur. Gupuk iwi lyel odiko con, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ci pe gunongo kome i lyel; ci gudwogo cen kun giwaco ni gineno lumalaika ma onyute botgi, kun giwaco ni en kwo gire. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Ci jo mukene ma onongo gitye kacel kwedwa gucito iwi lyel, gunongo tye kit macalo mon ca guwaco; ento pe guneno kome.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ci Yecu owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Wun luming, dok bene cwinywu nyap pien wugale me ye lok ducu ma lunebi yam guloko!</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" /><char style="wj">Wutamoni pe onongo myero ni Kricito ma Lubanga oyero onen can magi ducu, wek odony ideyone?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ci Yecu otito ki gin lok ducu ma mako kome matye i ginacoya ducu, cake wa ikom Moses, nio kwede wa ikom coc pa lunebi ducu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ka dong gunyiko cok ki paco ma onongo gicito iyeni, Yecu otime calo mito kato akata ki wote, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />ento gudiye matek kun giwaco ni, “Bed botwa, pien piny dong cok yutu, dok ceng bene dong cok poto woko.” Piman en odonyo i ot ci obedo kwedgi. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ka tye i dog cam kacel kwedgi, ci omako mugati, opwoyo Lubanga, ci obaro iye, omiyo botgi. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Wanggi oyabe, gungeye; ci cutcut en orwenyo woko ki iwang gi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ci gucako penye keken gi ni, “Pe cwinywa nakanen obedo ka puke ikare ma en tye kalok kwedwa i wangayo, kun gonyo te ginacoya botwa?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ci gua woko icawanu kikome, gucako dok i Jerucalem; ci gunongo lupwonyene apar wiye acel ca gucoke kacel, ki jo ma onongo tye botgi. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Ci lupwonyene aryonu guwaco botgi ni, “Rwot ocer ada, dok bene onyute bot Cimon!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Lacen jo aryo ni gutito lok ma otime botgi i wangayo, ki kit ma gungeye kwede ikare ma obaro i mugati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu onyute bot Lupwonyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:14-18">Mar 14:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Tic 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ka pud gitye kaloko lok man, [ Yecu kikome ocung ikin gi, ci owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Kuc obed kwedwu!”</char>] <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ento komgi oto woko lirut, gulworo pien gutamo ni gineno tipu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Pingo cwinywu poto? Pingo wupenye kekenwu icwinywu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" /><char style="wj">Wunen cinga, ki tyena, man an kikoma; wubonga, wunena; pien tipu pe tye kikom ki cogo kit macalo wuneno an atye kwede.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ka dong Yecu owaco lok man, ci onyutu cinge ki tyene botgi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Pe onongo gin gitwero ye, gupong ki yomcwiny, kun giuru; ci Yecu openyogi ni, <char style="wj">“Wutye ki gin mo kany me acama?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ci gumiye but rec ma gubulu, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />ka ogamo, ci ocamo inyimgi.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Lacen owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Man aye loka mayam aloko botwu ikare ma onongo pud atye kwedwu, ni, lok ducu ma kicoyo ikoma i cik pa Moses, ki i coc pa lunebi, ki i jabuli myero ocobe kakare.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ci oyabo tamgi wek guniang ginacoya, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />ci lacen owaco botgi ni, <char style="wj">“Yam kicoyo kit man ni, Kricito ma Lubanga oyero myero onen can, ci inino me adeke myero ocer ki ikin jo ma oto,</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" /><char style="wj">dok myero kitit lok ikom ngut makelo weko bal inyinge bot rok ducu kun kicako ki i Jerucalem.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" /><char style="wj">Wun wucaden me lok man.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Tic 1:4</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Nen, abicwalo botwu gin ma Wora ociko; ento myero wubed i Jerucalem, nio ka wubipong ki tek ma a ki i polo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitingo Yecu malo i polo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Tic 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Tic 1:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Lacen Yecu otero lukwenane nio wa Betania, ka otingo cinge malo ci omiyo gum ikomgi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ka en pud tye kamiyo gum ikomgi, ci opoke woko ki ikin gi, [ kitinge, kitere i polo.] <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus is taken to heaven" file="4302451.TIF" size="col" copy="Anie Vollton" ref="24:51">Kitingo Yecu malo i polo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Guwore, lacen gudwogo i Jerucalem ki yomcwiny madit, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />gurii i Ot pa Lubanga jwijwi, kun gipwoyo Lubanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>